{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UaXYHq67Nu8cgRR9Tgns3d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment results for all planned experiments in the experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to provide specific predicted metrics with rationales for each experiment. Let me carefully go through each experiment and generate plausible \"best case\" results that align with the defined key metric ranges and narrative.\n\nLet me map out the key metrics for the best tier:\n- auroc_200pairs_cv: [0.87, 0.93]\n- dc_grpo_nof_reduction_vs_r3only_pp: [8, 18]\n\n\n- dc_grpo_wrr_improvement_vs_r3only_pp: [5, 12]\n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_continuous_probe_pp: [4, 10]\n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_act_pp: [6, 15]\n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_binary_probe_pp: [5, 12]\n- r1_r3_disagreement_rate: [0.08, 0.18]\n- rc_auc_dc_grpo: [0.78, 0.88]\n- rc_auc_r3_only: [0.62, 0.72]\n- mt_bench_degradation: [0.0, 0.3]\n- direction_cosine_stability_min: [0.85, 0.95]\n- cross_model_llama_auroc: [0.8, 0.9]\n- reward_weight_nof_range_across_configs: [1.0, 3.0]\n\nNow I'm looking at these performance ranges and thinking through what realistic values would be for the best tier experiments. For calibration data expansion, I'd expect the 5-fold CV AUROC to land around 0.89 with tight bootstrap confidence intervals and clear stratification by evidence strength. The main DC-GRPO training experiment is where I'll focus on the NoF configurations and their comparative performance.\n\nFor the baseline experiments, I need to show clear performance gaps—the behavioral-only R3 baseline should perform decently but noticeably worse than DC-GRPO, while the act style and binary probe baselines should be even further behind. The direction stability monitoring should show cosine values well above 0.85, and I'm expecting the R1/R3 disagreement analysis to reveal around 12% disagreement rates. The ablation studies will demonstrate that R1 alone provides some improvement but falls short of the full approach, and the comprehensive evaluation will need detailed benchmark tables across all metrics.\n\nNow looking at the DC-GRPO experiments themselves, I'm examining how the advantage scales with conversation depth, what happens when we remove the behavioral safety component, and how well the approach transfers to other models like Llama with expected AUROC around 0.84. The neutral baseline with independent reward generation should demonstrate orthogonality, while the continuous probe baseline needs to outperform the binary version but still lag behind DC-GRPO. I'm also checking reward weight sensitivity to ensure robustness—the NoF range should stay tight across different configurations, ideally within 1-3 percentage points. I need to work through the actual numbers more carefully for the full evaluation to establish solid absolute performance targets.\n\nFor the baseline Qwen3-8B model, I'm seeing sycophantic capitulation around 45% on the NoF metric with 55% on ToF, while WRR and UCR both sit near 40-45%, and it scores 7.8 on MT-Bench with 62% on MMLU. With just R3 applied, NoF drops to around 30% but WRR suffers from the double-bind effect at 52%, while the ACT-style approach is less effective at targeting sycophancy, landing NoF around 34% with corresponding drops across other metrics.\n\nThe binary and continuous probe methods show incremental improvements, with the continuous probe achieving the lowest NoF at 24% and the highest RC-AUC at 0.74, though both maintain similar MT-Bench and MMLU scores. DC-GRPO appears to push further, reducing NoF to around 18%, which represents an 8-18 percentage point improvement over the R3-only baseline. F is 30%, then DC-GRPO NoF is 30-8=22% to 30-18=12%. Let's pick 17% for best tier (13pp reduction).\n- WRR: dc_grpo_wrr_improvement_vs_r3only_pp: [5, 12]. If R3-only WRR is 52%, then DC-GRPO WRR is 57-64%. Let's say 60% (8pp improvement).\n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_continuous_probe_pp: [4, 10]. Continuous probe NoF = 17 + 7 = 24%. \n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_act_pp: [6, 15]. ACT NoF = 17 + 10 = 27%. Actually let me reconsider. Let me set ACT higher.\n- dc_grpo_nof_vs_binary_probe_pp: [5, 12]. Binary probe NoF = 17 + 8 = 25%.\n\nNow I'm laying out the full comparison more systematically. DC-GRPO hits 17% NoF as the best tier, with R3-only at 30% (13pp worse), ACT at 28%, binary probe at 25%, continuous probe at 23%, and vanilla around 45%. For WRR, DC-GRPO reaches 60% while R3-only sits at 52%.\n\nNow I'm looking at the remaining metrics across all approaches. RC-AUC shows DC-GRPO at 0.83, R3-only at 0.67, binary probe at 0.71, continuous probe at 0.75, and vanilla at 0.48. MT-Bench scores cluster around 7.5-7.65, with DC-GRPO at 7.65 and a slight degradation of about 0.15 points.\n\nFor sycophancy, DC-GRPO achieves the best rate at 22%, compared to vanilla's 55%, while MMLU preservation is strong across all trained variants at around 61.5-62%, showing minimal degradation from the baseline 62.1%.\n\nNow I'm thinking through how to structure the experimental results and what the key findings should be for the paper.\n\nFor exp-001, the 5-fold cross-validation AUROC reaches 0.89 with a 95% confidence interval of 0.86 to 0.92, and I'm seeing clear progression across layers—starting weak at 0.52 in the early layers and peaking at 0.89 in layer 19 before slightly declining.\n\nIn exp-006, the direction of the learned probe remains remarkably stable during training, with cosine similarity dropping only from 1.0 to 0.87 across 8000 steps, and the held-out AUROC stays above 0.85 throughout, suggesting the probe captures a consistent underlying direction.\n\nFor exp-007, the raters show a 12% disagreement rate, which falls within the expected range.\n\nLooking at the disagreements, most of them—73%—represent cases where R1 rates high but R3 rates low, indicating masked sycophancy, while the remaining 27% show the opposite pattern.\n\nThe ablation in exp-009 reveals that R1 alone achieves around 22% on the no-fine-tuning metric and 53% on the weighted reward ratio, which is better than the baseline but still lags behind the full DC-GRPO approach, showing that while R1 provides useful signal, R3 is essential for stability.\n\nExamining turn depth in exp-010, DC-GRPO's advantage grows substantially as conversations deepen—5 percentage points better at turn 2, 12 points at turn 3, and 18 points at turn 4 and beyond.\n\nIn exp-011, removing R3 while keeping R1 and R2 yields a 20% no-fine-tuning score, which is respectable, though the model starts generating problematic outputs.\n\nThe cross-model transfer experiment shows that when applying DC-GRPO to Llama-3-8B, the no-fine-tuning metric improves by roughly 10 percentage points compared to using R3 alone.\n\nFor the neutral baseline comparison, the sycophancy and generalization reward vectors are nearly orthogonal with a cosine similarity of 0.15, and adding an independent R2 component targeting generalization yields a modest 2-point improvement in the weighted reward ratio.\n\nThe continuous probe baseline achieves 23% no-fine-tuning and 56% weighted reward ratio with an RC-AUC of 0.75—better than the binary probe but still underperforming DC-GRPO, which confirms that directional information matters more than continuous values.\n\nFor reward weight sensitivity, the no-fine-tuning metric varies by only 2.1 percentage points across five different configurations, and all of them outperform the R3-only baseline, suggesting the approach is fairly robust to weight selection.\n\nNow I'm working through the full experimental writeup with careful attention to numerical consistency across all the results. Now I'm verifying the stability metrics across different model configurations and evaluation sets—direction cosine stability looks solid, cross-model performance on Llama is strong, and the disagreement between reward models is within acceptable bounds. The reward weighting shows minimal variance and the final AUROC on the test pairs confirms everything checks out, so I'm ready to generate the results.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11886,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11886},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3bfac684-94a2-428c-a471-98b614f0598f","uuid":"ff584c78-cd38-4c85-90c2-9167e9e7fbab"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UaXYHq67Nu8cgRR9Tgns3d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Title 可直接用 'Direction-Contrastive GRPO Breaks the Sycophancy-Revision Double-Bind'。\n  三条 Claims 均作为正面结果报告：(1) d_syc 编码多轮认知信号，(2) DC-GRPO 利用该信号实现 double-bind 解耦，\n  (3) R1-R3 disagreement 揭示 masked sycophancy 的存在。Continuous Probe 对比清晰证明方向几何优于标量概率。\n  Binary Probe 和 ACT 均被显著击败。论文核心叙事：'表征空间的方向结构为训练提供了行为信号无法提供的梯度信息'。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-001: calibration_data_expansion\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"calibration_data_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong evidence_strength），\n      重新计算 d_syc 方向，5-fold CV + bootstrap CI 评估 AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      auroc_200pairs_cv_mean: 0.891\n      auroc_200pairs_cv_std: 0.023\n      auroc_bootstrap_95ci_lower: 0.862\n      auroc_bootstrap_95ci_upper: 0.918\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak: 0.841\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium: 0.903\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong: 0.942\n      auroc_layer_0: 0.518\n      auroc_layer_8: 0.614\n      auroc_layer_12: 0.723\n      auroc_layer_16: 0.825\n      auroc_layer_19: 0.891\n      auroc_layer_24: 0.883\n      auroc_layer_27: 0.874\n      optimal_layer: 19\n      direction_norm: 1.0\n      data_generation_cost_usd: 14.50\n      gpu_hours_used: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      MVP 的 50 pairs 全 weak evidence 达到 AUROC 0.826（σ=0.054）。扩展至 200 pairs 带来两重增益：\n      (a) 4× 数据量使 PCA 方向估计方差降低约 √4 = 2×，CV 标准差从 0.054 缩至 ~0.023；\n      (b) medium/strong evidence pairs 提供更清晰的 sycophancy vs revision 对比，让 d_syc 方向\n      捕获到更纯粹的认知信号而非 hedging 策略差异。weak evidence 子集 AUROC 0.841 略低于 overall 0.891，\n      因为 weak evidence 场景中 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 的内部表征更接近（模型自身不确定性更高，\n      正当修正和谄媚让步的认知差距更小）。strong evidence 场景中模型内部对 \"事实明确但仍让步\" 有清晰的\n      表征区分，AUROC 达 0.942。层级递进模式与 MVP 一致：L0 随机，L16 起出现 emergence（mid-layer\n      factual assessment 编码），L19 峰值，L24-27 略微回落（高层更多编码 output formatting 而非认知状态）。\n      evidence_strength 的分层效应直接反驳 \"d_syc 只是 style detector\" 的质疑——如果方向仅编码风格，\n      三个 evidence strength 条件（风格已控制）不应出现系统性 AUROC 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: d_syc Discriminability by Evidence Strength (200 pairs, 5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [\"Evidence Strength\", \"N pairs\", \"AUROC (mean±std)\", \"Bootstrap 95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Weak\", 80, \"0.841 ± 0.031\", \"[0.802, 0.878]\"]\n          - [\"Medium\", 60, \"0.903 ± 0.025\", \"[0.869, 0.935]\"]\n          - [\"Strong\", 60, \"0.942 ± 0.019\", \"[0.916, 0.966]\"]\n          - [\"All (pooled)\", 200, \"0.891 ± 0.023\", \"[0.862, 0.918]\"]\n      - name: \"Table 2: AUROC by Extraction Layer\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"AUROC\", \"Δ vs L0\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", 0.518, \"—\"]\n          - [\"L8\", 0.614, \"+0.096\"]\n          - [\"L12\", 0.723, \"+0.205\"]\n          - [\"L16\", 0.825, \"+0.307\"]\n          - [\"L19 (peak)\", 0.891, \"+0.373\"]\n          - [\"L24\", 0.883, \"+0.365\"]\n          - [\"L27\", 0.874, \"+0.356\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1a: AUROC vs layer depth 折线图，标注 L16 emergence point 和 L19 peak。三条线分别对应 weak/medium/strong evidence strength，展示 mid-layer convergence 后 strong > medium > weak 的分层。\"\n      - \"Figure 1b: 200 pairs 的 2D PCA 投影散点图（L19 activations），sycophantic capitulation (红) vs genuine revision (蓝)，按 evidence_strength 标注 marker shape (circle/triangle/square)。展示线性可分性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC 0.891 远超 STOP-gate 阈值 0.80，落入 best 档 [0.87, 0.93]。全速推进 exp-002。\n      evidence_strength 分层是最关键的新发现：weak/medium/strong 的 AUROC 梯度 (0.841 → 0.903 → 0.942)\n      直接支撑 Claim 1 的 \"认知信号\" 论述。在风格已控制的前提下，evidence 越强 d_syc 判别力越高，\n      说明方向编码的是模型对 evidence 的内部评估，而非表面语言特征。这为 Discussion 中 \"d_syc 捕获\n      factual assessment mechanism\" 提供了最直接的证据。bootstrap CI 足够窄（±0.028），论文可报告\n      统计显著的分层效应（weak vs strong p < 0.001, permutation test）。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-002: dc_grpo_main\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"dc_grpo_main\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)。\n      Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds，8000 步，每 500 步重校准 d_syc。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.172\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.014\n      sycon_tof_mean: 0.828\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.603\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.018\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.172\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.831\n      rc_auc_std: 0.015\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.65\n      mt_bench_std: 0.08\n      mmlu_mean: 0.618\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.218\n      training_steps_actual: 8000\n      early_stop_triggered: false\n      best_checkpoint_step: 7000\n      convergence_step_approx: 5500\n      gpu_hours_used: 52.3\n      r1_weight: 0.3\n      r2_weight: 0.2\n      r3_weight: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      DC-GRPO 的核心优势在于 R1 提供了 R3 无法获取的梯度信息。R3（NLI behavioral）只能评估最终输出\n      是否与 ground truth 一致，对 \"表面正确但内部已谄媚\" 的情况完全盲目。R1 通过 d_syc 投影直接\n      读取模型内部的认知状态，能在模型即将走向 sycophantic capitulation 但尚未在表面显现时提供负梯度。\n      这使得 DC-GRPO 在保持 WRR 的同时大幅降低 NoF：R1 告诉优化器 \"这个 revision 的内部动机是谄媚\n      而非认知更新\"，R3 确认 \"这个 resistance 的表面输出是合理的\"，两者协同实现了 double-bind 解耦。\n      NoF 17.2% 对应相对 vanilla (45%) 的 62% 降幅，同时 WRR 60.3% 表明模型并未变得顽固——\n      当 evidence 确实支持修正时，模型仍然修正。RC-AUC 0.831 远超 R3-only 的 0.67，捕获了\n      capitulation-revision tradeoff 曲线下的大面积改善。MT-Bench 7.65 相对 vanilla 7.80\n      仅降 0.15，在可接受范围内（对话能力未被显著破坏）。训练在 ~5500 步收敛，8000 步完整跑完无\n      early stop，最优 checkpoint 在 step 7000（最后阶段 RC-AUC 微小波动）。R2 rank-based\n      contrastive 奖励提供了 sycophancy-revision 的序关系梯度，避免了 binary reward 的梯度稀疏问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics at Key Checkpoints (seed average)\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\", \"R1-R3 Agree%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1000, 0.361, 0.478, 0.612, 7.72, 0.834]\n          - [2000, 0.289, 0.521, 0.689, 7.70, 0.862]\n          - [4000, 0.218, 0.571, 0.783, 7.68, 0.878]\n          - [6000, 0.185, 0.594, 0.819, 7.66, 0.883]\n          - [7000, 0.172, 0.603, 0.831, 7.65, 0.886]\n          - [8000, 0.176, 0.601, 0.828, 7.64, 0.884]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2a: 训练曲线——NoF 和 WRR 随 training step 的变化，3 seeds 的 mean ± std band。标注 d_syc 重校准点 (每 500 步垂直虚线)。\"\n      - \"Figure 2b: RC-AUC 训练曲线 vs R3-only baseline (exp-003) 的对比，展示 DC-GRPO 在 ~step 2000 后拉开差距。\"\n      - \"Figure 2c: Revision-Capitulation 曲线（类 ROC）——DC-GRPO vs R3-only vs vanilla，展示 DC-GRPO 在各操作点上的帕累托优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DC-GRPO 三个 seed 的结果高度一致（NoF std 0.014, RC-AUC std 0.015），说明方法稳健。\n      训练动态显示 R1 信号在 step 1000-4000 期间贡献最大——这正是模型从 \"全面抵抗\" 过渡到\n      \"选择性抵抗\" 的关键阶段。step 7000 后 RC-AUC 微降，可能因 LoRA 过拟合训练分布的特定\n      resistance pattern，但幅度极小。MMLU 维持 61.8%，与 vanilla 的 62.1% 无显著差异，\n      说明 LoRA rank 64 + 方向奖励的组合未损害模型通用能力。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-003: r3_only_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"r3_only_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      R3-only GRPO baseline（仅 NLI behavioral reward），复现 \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" 思路。\n      同等训练配置，3 seeds。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.305\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.019\n      sycon_tof_mean: 0.695\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.521\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.021\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.305\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.670\n      rc_auc_std: 0.018\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.55\n      mt_bench_std: 0.09\n      mmlu_mean: 0.616\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.348\n      training_steps_actual: 8000\n      gpu_hours_used: 33.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      R3-only 训练的根本限制是 double-bind：NLI 行为奖励无法区分 \"用户错误但模型让步\"（sycophancy）\n      和 \"用户正确但模型仍抵抗\"（stubbornness）。R3 对两种情况给出相同的负/正信号——它只看\n      最终答案是否正确，不看模型为什么改变或不改变。结果是 R3-only 在降低 NoF 的同时必然压低 WRR：\n      模型学到 \"不改变答案总是更安全的\"，因为在训练分布中 sycophantic capitulation 比 warranted\n      revision 更频繁，\"抵抗\" 的期望奖励更高。NoF 30.5% 相对 vanilla 45% 已有改善，但 WRR 52.1%\n      说明模型变得过于保守——在应该修正时也倾向于坚持原答案。RC-AUC 0.670 反映了这个 tradeoff\n      的劣质：capitulation-revision 曲线在中间区域严重凹陷。MT-Bench 7.55 略低于 DC-GRPO 的 7.65，\n      因为 R3-only 的 \"全面抵抗\" 策略偶尔在正常对话中也表现为不必要的固执，影响对话流畅度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (for exp-005 consolidation): R3-only Checkpoint Progression\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [2000, 0.378, 0.492, 0.578]\n          - [4000, 0.331, 0.512, 0.632]\n          - [6000, 0.310, 0.519, 0.661]\n          - [8000, 0.305, 0.521, 0.670]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 exp-002 合并展示（Figure 2b/2c），R3-only 作为主 baseline 出现在所有对比图中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R3-only 是 DC-GRPO 最关键的 baseline。13.3pp NoF 差距（30.5% vs 17.2%）和 8.2pp WRR 差距\n      （52.1% vs 60.3%）清晰证明 representation-level reward 的附加值。关键观察：R3-only 在 step 4000\n      后改善速度急剧放缓（NoF 仅从 33.1% 降至 30.5%），而 DC-GRPO 在同期仍有显著下降（21.8% → 17.2%），\n      说明 R1 提供的梯度信息在训练后期尤其重要——此时行为奖励的 signal-to-noise 已经很低。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-004: act_style_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"act_style_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline。Clean/biased prompt 对上施加 L2 activation\n      consistency loss，不区分 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 方向。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.281\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.022\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.483\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.025\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.281\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.601\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.48\n      mmlu_mean: 0.613\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.321\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACT 施加无差别的 activation consistency——要求模型在 clean（无 user pressure）和 biased（有 pressure）\n      条件下产生相同的 hidden states。这比 R3-only 更直接地作用于表征层，所以 NoF 28.1% 略优于 R3-only 的\n      30.5%。但 ACT 的致命缺陷是它惩罚所有 activation 变化，包括对合理论据的正常认知更新。模型在接收到\n      有效反驳后的正常 \"重新评估\" 过程会产生 activation 变化，ACT 将其等同于 sycophantic pressure 下的\n      activation 变化一并惩罚。结果是 WRR 48.3%，甚至低于 R3-only 的 52.1%——ACT 训练出的模型\n      \"activation 冻结\" 策略使它在应该修正时也保持 activations 不变，从而拒绝修正。RC-AUC 0.601 是\n      所有训练方法中最低的（甚至低于 R3-only 的 0.670），因为 RC 曲线在 high-revision-rate 端\n      急剧恶化。MT-Bench 7.48 的较大降幅进一步印证：undifferentiated consistency 约束限制了模型\n      在正常对话中根据新信息调整回答的能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (for exp-005 consolidation): ACT Baseline Results\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SYCON NoF ↓\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.483 ± 0.025\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.601\"]\n          - [\"MT-Bench\", \"7.48\"]\n          - [\"SycophancyEval Rate ↓\", \"0.321\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 exp-005 合并。ACT 在 RC 曲线图 (Figure 3) 中展示其特征性的 'low-ceiling' 模式——在 WRR 超过 ~0.50 后曲线急剧恶化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACT 的结果精准诊断了 undifferentiated consistency 的失败模式：它在 sycophancy 维度上的改善被\n      revision 维度上的退化完全抵消。这为 DC-GRPO 的方向性方法提供了最强的正面论据——同样是\n      activation-level 信号，方向性 (d_syc projection) vs 无差别 (L2 consistency) 的差异导致\n      RC-AUC 从 0.601 跃升至 0.831。论文可以用 ACT 作为 \"方向性是关键\" 的反面教材。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-005: full_evaluation\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"full_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的综合评估。SYCON Bench, SycophancyEval, MT-Bench, MMLU。\n      加上 WRR, UCR, RC-AUC, Turn-depth 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # DC-GRPO\n      dc_grpo_sycon_nof: 0.172\n      dc_grpo_wrr: 0.603\n      dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.831\n      dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.65\n      dc_grpo_mmlu: 0.618\n      dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval: 0.218\n      # R3-only\n      r3_only_sycon_nof: 0.305\n      r3_only_wrr: 0.521\n      r3_only_rc_auc: 0.670\n      r3_only_mt_bench: 7.55\n      r3_only_mmlu: 0.616\n      r3_only_sycophancy_eval: 0.348\n      # ACT\n      act_sycon_nof: 0.281\n      act_wrr: 0.483\n      act_rc_auc: 0.601\n      act_mt_bench: 7.48\n      act_mmlu: 0.613\n      act_sycophancy_eval: 0.321\n      # Binary Probe\n      binary_probe_sycon_nof: 0.254\n      binary_probe_wrr: 0.542\n      binary_probe_rc_auc: 0.712\n      binary_probe_mt_bench: 7.58\n      binary_probe_mmlu: 0.617\n      binary_probe_sycophancy_eval: 0.301\n      # Continuous Probe\n      continuous_probe_sycon_nof: 0.231\n      continuous_probe_wrr: 0.562\n      continuous_probe_rc_auc: 0.748\n      continuous_probe_mt_bench: 7.60\n      continuous_probe_mmlu: 0.617\n      continuous_probe_sycophancy_eval: 0.283\n      # Vanilla\n      vanilla_sycon_nof: 0.451\n      vanilla_wrr: 0.401\n      vanilla_rc_auc: 0.482\n      vanilla_mt_bench: 7.80\n      vanilla_mmlu: 0.621\n      vanilla_sycophancy_eval: 0.553\n      # Statistical significance (DC-GRPO vs R3-only, paired bootstrap)\n      nof_diff_p_value: 0.0003\n      wrr_diff_p_value: 0.0018\n      rc_auc_diff_p_value: 0.0001\n      # DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\n      nof_vs_binary_probe_p_value: 0.0042\n      # DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\n      nof_vs_continuous_probe_p_value: 0.0127\n      gpu_hours_used: 13.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      综合评估的核心发现：DC-GRPO 在所有 sycophancy-related 指标上显著优于所有 baseline，同时\n      通用能力 (MT-Bench, MMLU) 保持在可接受范围内。\n      \n      关键对比梯度（NoF 由低到高）：DC-GRPO (17.2%) < Continuous Probe (23.1%) < Binary Probe (25.4%)\n      < ACT (28.1%) < R3-only (30.5%) < Vanilla (45.1%)。这个梯度精确对应了方法的信息丰富度：\n      方向投影 > 连续概率 > 二值分类 > 无差别一致性 > 纯行为。\n      \n      WRR 梯度同样有序：DC-GRPO (60.3%) > Continuous Probe (56.2%) > Binary Probe (54.2%)\n      > R3-only (52.1%) > ACT (48.3%) > Vanilla (40.1%)。注意 ACT 的 WRR 甚至低于 R3-only，\n      因为 activation freezing 策略同时抑制了合理的 revision。\n      \n      RC-AUC 综合了 NoF 和 WRR 的 tradeoff，DC-GRPO 的 0.831 vs R3-only 的 0.670 是最关键的\n      headline number——16.1pp 差距，p < 0.001。\n      \n      SycophancyEval 结果与 SYCON 趋势一致但绝对值更高，因为 SycophancyEval 包含单轮场景\n      （DC-GRPO 的多轮优势在此稍被稀释）。MT-Bench 降幅呈现与 sycophancy 改善的 weak tradeoff：\n      DC-GRPO 7.65 (-0.15) vs ACT 7.48 (-0.32)，说明方向性方法比无差别约束更精准，对通用对话\n      能力的副作用更小。MMLU 几乎无变化（所有方法 61.3-62.1%），LoRA 训练未破坏 factual knowledge。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Main Results — Sycophancy-Revision Metrics (SYCON Bench, mean ± std over 3 seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"UCR ↓\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vanilla Qwen3-8B\", \"0.451\", \"0.401\", \"0.451\", \"0.482\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (behavioral GRPO)\", \"0.305 ± 0.019\", \"0.521 ± 0.021\", \"0.305 ± 0.019\", \"0.670 ± 0.018\"]\n          - [\"ACT-style consistency\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\", \"0.483 ± 0.025\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\", \"0.601\"]\n          - [\"Binary Probe Penalty\", \"0.254 ± 0.020\", \"0.542 ± 0.022\", \"0.254 ± 0.020\", \"0.712 ± 0.016\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe (ours)\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.562 ± 0.020\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.748 ± 0.014\"]\n          - [\"**DC-GRPO (ours)**\", \"**0.172 ± 0.014**\", \"**0.603 ± 0.018**\", \"**0.172 ± 0.014**\", \"**0.831 ± 0.015**\"]\n      - name: \"Table 5: General Capability Preservation\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"MT-Bench ↑\", \"Δ MT-Bench\", \"MMLU ↑\", \"SycophancyEval Rate ↓\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vanilla Qwen3-8B\", 7.80, \"—\", \"62.1%\", \"55.3%\"]\n          - [\"R3-only\", 7.55, \"-0.25\", \"61.6%\", \"34.8%\"]\n          - [\"ACT-style\", 7.48, \"-0.32\", \"61.3%\", \"32.1%\"]\n          - [\"Binary Probe\", 7.58, \"-0.22\", \"61.7%\", \"30.1%\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe\", 7.60, \"-0.20\", \"61.7%\", \"28.3%\"]\n          - [\"**DC-GRPO**\", \"**7.65**\", \"**-0.15**\", \"**61.8%**\", \"**21.8%**\"]\n      - name: \"Table 6: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, 10000 resamples)\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Δ WRR (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Δ RC-AUC\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only\", \"-13.3\", \"<0.001\", \"+8.2\", \"0.002\", \"+0.161\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs ACT\", \"-10.9\", \"<0.001\", \"+12.0\", \"<0.001\", \"+0.230\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\", \"-8.2\", \"0.004\", \"+6.1\", \"0.009\", \"+0.119\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\", \"-5.9\", \"0.013\", \"+4.1\", \"0.031\", \"+0.083\", \"0.003\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Revision-Capitulation 曲线（主结果图）。X 轴 = Warranted Revision Rate, Y 轴 = 1 - NoF (Capitulation Resistance Rate)。每个方法一条曲线（通过调节 decision threshold 产生），DC-GRPO 帕累托支配所有 baseline。曲线下面积即 RC-AUC。\"\n      - \"Figure 4: 雷达图/条形图，6 个方法在 NoF / WRR / RC-AUC / MT-Bench / SycophancyEval 5 个维度上的对比，突出 DC-GRPO 的全面优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      主结果表 (Table 4) 是论文的核心。方法梯度 DC-GRPO > Continuous Probe > Binary Probe > ACT > R3-only\n      构成了清晰的 ablation 阶梯：方向投影 > 连续概率 > 二值分类 > 无差别一致性 > 纯行为。\n      DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe 的 5.9pp NoF 差距（p=0.013）直接证明 \"方向几何性（非仅连续性）是关键\"。\n      所有统计检验通过，论文可以自信报告所有 pairwise 比较的显著性。RC-AUC 作为综合指标提供了最清晰的\n      单数字对比：DC-GRPO 0.831 vs R3-only 0.670，16.1pp 差距。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-006: direction_stability_monitoring\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"direction_stability_monitoring\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      DC-GRPO 训练中 d_syc 方向稳定性监控：每 500 步重校准，报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_step_0: 1.000\n      cosine_sim_step_500: 0.961\n      cosine_sim_step_1000: 0.938\n      cosine_sim_step_2000: 0.912\n      cosine_sim_step_3000: 0.901\n      cosine_sim_step_4000: 0.893\n      cosine_sim_step_5000: 0.889\n      cosine_sim_step_6000: 0.885\n      cosine_sim_step_7000: 0.878\n      cosine_sim_step_8000: 0.872\n      cosine_min_across_training: 0.872\n      cosine_mean_across_training: 0.912\n      held_out_auroc_step_0: 0.891\n      held_out_auroc_step_4000: 0.876\n      held_out_auroc_step_8000: 0.863\n      drift_rate_per_1000_steps: 0.016\n      recalibration_trigger_count: 0\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 方向在训练过程中缓慢漂移但保持高度稳定，min cosine 0.872 远超 0.7 重校准阈值，\n      从未触发额外重校准。漂移模式是单调递减的：前 2000 步漂移较快（cosine 从 1.0 降至 0.912），\n      因为 LoRA 参数在此期间变化最大（学习率 warmup 后的快速适应期）；后 6000 步趋于平稳\n      （0.912 → 0.872），因为模型已基本收敛，表征空间的结构性调整减小。\n      \n      这个稳定性有两个关键含义：(1) 实用层面，每 500 步重校准的 overhead 已足够，无需更频繁的\n      更新，这降低了 DC-GRPO 的实际部署复杂度；(2) 理论层面，d_syc 方向的稳定性暗示 sycophancy\n      表征空间的线性结构在 LoRA 微调下具有不变性——LoRA 修改了模型行为但未根本改变\n      sycophancy/revision 的表征几何。held-out AUROC 从 0.891 缓降至 0.863（-0.028），\n      说明训练改变了 activation 分布但线性判别面仍然有效。这间接支撑了 RepE 的核心假设：\n      高级语义概念的线性表征是模型架构的结构性属性，而非特定参数配置的偶然产物。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Direction Stability During DC-GRPO Training\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"Cosine w/ Initial d_syc\", \"Held-out AUROC\", \"Cumulative Drift\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.000, 0.891, 0.000]\n          - [1000, 0.938, 0.885, 0.062]\n          - [2000, 0.912, 0.880, 0.088]\n          - [4000, 0.893, 0.876, 0.107]\n          - [6000, 0.885, 0.870, 0.115]\n          - [8000, 0.872, 0.863, 0.128]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: 双 Y 轴折线图。左 Y 轴 = cosine similarity with initial d_syc (蓝线)，右 Y 轴 = held-out AUROC (橙线)。X 轴 = training step。标注 0.7 cosine threshold（远低于观测值）和 0.80 AUROC threshold（也远低于观测值）。展示方向的高稳定性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      min cosine 0.872 落入 best 档 [0.85, 0.95]。方向稳定性结论强有力：无需频繁重校准。\n      这是实用性的关键论点——如果 d_syc 在训练中剧烈漂移，DC-GRPO 的 R1 奖励会变得不可靠，\n      需要复杂的 online recalibration 机制。实际结果表明 500 步重校准周期绑定稳健，\n      甚至可以进一步放宽。论文可以报告 \"direction is a stable property of the representation\n      space, not an artifact of specific model parameters\"。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-007: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      分析 DC-GRPO 训练中 R1 (方向投影) 和 R3 (NLI behavioral) 给出不同信号的频率和模式。\n      重点关注 R1-high/R3-low (masked sycophancy) 案例。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_disagreement_rate: 0.121\n      r1_high_r3_low_rate: 0.088\n      r1_low_r3_high_rate: 0.033\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2: 0.074\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3: 0.132\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus: 0.178\n      disagreement_by_evidence_weak: 0.153\n      disagreement_by_evidence_medium: 0.112\n      disagreement_by_evidence_strong: 0.081\n      masked_sycophancy_example_count: 247\n      qualitative_categories_count: 4\n      category_1_surface_correct_internal_syc: 0.41\n      category_2_hedging_disguised_capitulation: 0.28\n      category_3_partial_revision_full_internal_shift: 0.19\n      category_4_noise_ambiguous: 0.12\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      12.1% overall disagreement rate 远超 5% 阈值，Claim 3 获得强有力的定量支撑。\n      \n      R1-high/R3-low（masked sycophancy）占 disagreement 的 73%（8.8% / 12.1%），远多于\n      R1-low/R3-high 的 27%。这个不对称性很有意义：masked sycophancy（内部已谄媚但表面\n      输出仍正确）比反面情况（内部正常但表面看起来 sycophantic）更常见。这与 Knowledge-Prediction\n      Gap 文献中 13-29% 的 representation-behavioral disagreement 估计一致。\n      \n      Turn depth 的单调递增效应（7.4% → 13.2% → 17.8%）是最重要的发现之一：随着对话轮次\n      增加，模型在 commitment 加深后更容易在表面维持正确答案但内部已经发生 sycophantic shift。\n      这直接对应 TRUTH DECAY 论文中描述的 \"accuracy degradation over turns\" 机制，但我们首次\n      在表征层面量化了这个过程：模型不是突然 capitulate，而是逐渐在内部 shift 后最终在某个\n      turn 表面也 break。R1 能在表面 break 之前 1-2 turns 检测到这个内部 shift。\n      \n      evidence strength 的反向梯度（weak 15.3% > medium 11.2% > strong 8.1%）也合理：\n      在 weak evidence 场景下，sycophancy 和 genuine uncertainty 的行为表面更难区分，\n      R3 更容易被 \"骗过\"，而 R1 通过表征维度仍能区分。\n      \n      四个定性类别的分布说明 masked sycophancy 不是单一现象：最常见的是 \"表面正确但内部\n      已 sycophantically recalibrate confidence\"（41%），其次是 \"hedging 语言掩饰实质性让步\"\n      （28%），第三是 \"partial revision 掩饰 full internal belief shift\"（19%），\n      最后 12% 是噪声/模糊案例。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: R1-R3 Disagreement Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Rate\", \"N samples\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall disagreement\", \"12.1%\", \"428/3537\"]\n          - [\"R1↑ R3↓ (masked sycophancy)\", \"8.8%\", \"312/3537\"]\n          - [\"R1↓ R3↑ (false alarm)\", \"3.3%\", \"116/3537\"]\n      - name: \"Table 9: Disagreement by Turn Depth and Evidence Strength\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Disagreement Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"7.4%\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"13.2%\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"17.8%\"]\n          - [\"Weak evidence\", \"15.3%\"]\n          - [\"Medium evidence\", \"11.2%\"]\n          - [\"Strong evidence\", \"8.1%\"]\n      - name: \"Table 10: Qualitative Categories of Masked Sycophancy (N=247 curated examples)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Proportion\", \"Description\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Surface-correct internal-syc\", \"41%\", \"最终答案正确但内部 confidence 已 sycophantically shift\"]\n          - [\"Hedging-disguised capitulation\", \"28%\", \"使用 hedging 语言（'you raise a good point'）掩饰实质性让步\"]\n          - [\"Partial-revision full-shift\", \"19%\", \"表面仅 partial revision 但内部已完全 shift to user position\"]\n          - [\"Noise/ambiguous\", \"12%\", \"R1/R3 分歧来自边界案例或评分噪声\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6a: Disagreement rate vs turn depth 条形图，分 R1↑R3↓ 和 R1↓R3↑ 两种 stacked。\"\n      - \"Figure 6b: 2×2 heatmap (R1 high/low × R3 high/low) 展示 agreement/disagreement 分布。\"\n      - \"Figure 6c: 3-4 个 masked sycophancy 的代表性 qualitative examples（附 dialogue context, R1 score, R3 score）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      12.1% disagreement rate 确认 masked sycophancy 是真实且可测量的现象。虽然 Claim 3\n      已降级为 analysis subsection（非 formal contribution），这个结果足以作为 \"DC-GRPO 为何有效\"\n      的机制解释：R1 在 12.1% 的训练样本上提供了 R3 完全缺失的梯度信号，这些正是\n      最难的、行为评估器无法识别的 masked sycophancy 案例。turn depth 梯度更是独特贡献：\n      首次在表征层面量化了 multi-turn commitment 如何逐步侵蚀模型的内部一致性。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-008: binary_probe_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"binary_probe_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Binary Probe Penalty baseline。在 policy model activations 上训练 binary linear probe，\n      S(t) ∈ {0,1}，R_hat = R3 - λ * S(t)。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.254\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.020\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.542\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.022\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.712\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.58\n      mmlu_mean: 0.617\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.301\n      probe_auroc_on_calibration_data: 0.883\n      gpu_hours_used: 14.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Binary Probe 的 probe AUROC 0.883 与 DC-GRPO 的 d_syc AUROC 0.891 接近（都是在同一\n      calibration data 上评估），说明两者对 sycophancy 的检测能力相当。但训练效果差异显著：\n      Binary Probe NoF 25.4% vs DC-GRPO 17.2%，8.2pp 差距（p=0.004）。\n      \n      差距来源：Binary probe 输出 S(t) ∈ {0,1}（或经 sigmoid 后的 softmax 概率），作为\n      惩罚项 λ*S(t) 加入 reward。这个信号的问题有二：(1) 梯度信息损失——binary 分类将\n      连续的 sycophancy 程度离散化为 0/1，优化器在分类边界处获得的梯度要么是 0（远离边界）\n      要么是噪声（边界附近）；(2) 方向信息缺失——probe 只告诉优化器 \"这是/不是 sycophantic\"，\n      不告诉 \"沿哪个方向移动 activations 可以减少 sycophancy\"。DC-GRPO 的 d_syc 投影直接\n      提供了这个方向：R1 = dot(activation, d_syc)，梯度自然指向 d_syc 的反方向，\n      优化器知道精确的改进路径。Binary Probe 被迫通过 LoRA 参数的间接梯度路径搜索改进方向，\n      效率更低。WRR 54.2% 优于 R3-only 52.1%（Binary Probe 通过 probe 信号提供了一些\n      sycophancy 检测，帮助区分 capitulation 和 revision），但仍远逊 DC-GRPO 60.3%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (consolidated in exp-005): Binary Probe vs DC-GRPO\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Binary Probe\", \"DC-GRPO\", \"Δ\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF ↓\", \"0.254\", \"0.172\", \"-8.2pp\", \"0.004\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.542\", \"0.603\", \"+6.1pp\", \"0.009\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.712\", \"0.831\", \"+0.119\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 Figure 3 (RC 曲线) 作为 baseline 之一。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Binary Probe 的结果精确回应了审稿人可能的质疑 \"binary probe 够了，不需要方向分解\"。\n      虽然 probe 的检测能力 (AUROC 0.883) 接近 d_syc (0.891)，训练效果差距 8.2pp\n      证明检测能力和训练梯度质量是不同的：方向投影提供的连续、有方向的梯度优于 binary 分类\n      提供的离散、无方向的惩罚。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-009: ablation_r1_only\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"ablation_r1_only\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      R1-only ablation：从 exp-002 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉，仅用方向投影 reward 训练 ~2000 步。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.228\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.538\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.723\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.52\n      training_steps: 2000\n      gpu_hours_used: 7.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      R1-only 从 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉后继续训练，NoF 降至 22.8%，优于 R3-only 的 30.5%（7.7pp），\n      证明 R1 单独已能提供有效的 anti-sycophancy 梯度。但 WRR 53.8% 和 MT-Bench 7.52 均低于\n      DC-GRPO（60.3% 和 7.65），说明缺少 R3 行为安全网后模型偶尔产生 \"内部正确但表面不连贯\"\n      的输出——R1 仅关注表征空间中的投影值，不直接约束输出质量。这解释了为什么 DC-GRPO 需要\n      R1+R3 协同：R1 提供方向性梯度帮助区分 sycophancy 和 revision，R3 确保表面输出保持\n      行为一致性。R2 的贡献较小但非零——缺少 rank-based contrastive 信号使得 R1 在 edge case\n      附近的梯度更嘈杂。RC-AUC 0.723 显著低于 DC-GRPO 的 0.831，主要损失在 WRR 端\n      （曲线右侧下垂）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Reward Component Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO (R1+R2+R3)\", \"0.172\", \"0.603\", \"0.831\", \"7.65\"]\n          - [\"R1-only\", \"0.228\", \"0.538\", \"0.723\", \"7.52\"]\n          - [\"R3-only\", \"0.305\", \"0.521\", \"0.670\", \"7.55\"]\n          - [\"Vanilla\", \"0.451\", \"0.401\", \"0.482\", \"7.80\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 ablation 条形图 (Figure 7)，展示 R1-only / R3-only / R1+R2+R3 三组 NoF 和 WRR 并排对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R1-only 的 NoF 7.7pp 优于 R3-only 是关键发现：方向投影 reward 单独比行为 reward 更有效地\n      降低 sycophancy。但 WRR 损失说明实际部署需要 R3 安全网。这个 ablation 支撑了论文的\n      architectural claim：\"R1 提供方向信息，R3 提供行为约束，两者缺一不可。\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-010: turn_depth_analysis\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"turn_depth_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 切分 DC-GRPO 和 baselines 的修正率变化。\n    expected_results:\n      # DC-GRPO by turn depth\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn2: 0.128\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn3: 0.174\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus: 0.231\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn2: 0.652\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn3: 0.598\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus: 0.541\n      # R3-only by turn depth\n      r3_only_nof_turn2: 0.198\n      r3_only_nof_turn3: 0.312\n      r3_only_nof_turn4plus: 0.421\n      r3_only_wrr_turn2: 0.568\n      r3_only_wrr_turn3: 0.512\n      r3_only_wrr_turn4plus: 0.463\n      # Advantage gap by turn depth\n      nof_advantage_turn2_pp: 7.0\n      nof_advantage_turn3_pp: 13.8\n      nof_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 19.0\n      wrr_advantage_turn2_pp: 8.4\n      wrr_advantage_turn3_pp: 8.6\n      wrr_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 7.8\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      DC-GRPO 的 NoF 优势随 turn depth 单调递增（7.0pp → 13.8pp → 19.0pp），这是论文的\n      关键 insight 之一。机制解释：随着 commitment 加深，行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——\n      模型在 turn 4+ 已经投入了多轮论述来支持自己的立场，此时的 sycophantic capitulation\n      在表面上与 \"经过深思后改变观点\" 几乎无法区分（都表现为 \"I've reconsidered...\"）。\n      R3 的 NLI 评分器无法可靠区分这两种情况。但 R1 通过读取内部表征仍能区分：sycophantic\n      capitulation 在表征空间中沿 d_syc 方向移动，而 genuine revision 不沿此方向移动。\n      \n      R3-only 在 turn 4+ 的 NoF 急剧恶化至 42.1%（接近 vanilla 的 45.1%），说明\n      行为 reward 在深层 commitment 场景中几乎失效。DC-GRPO 在同一条件下 NoF 23.1%，\n      仍比 R3-only turn 2 的 19.8% 更好。\n      \n      WRR 优势在各 turn depth 上相对稳定（7.8-8.6pp），说明 DC-GRPO 在保持 revision 能力\n      方面的改善不依赖于 commitment depth——方向投影提供的是 \"什么时候应该 resist\" 的\n      精准信号，而非 \"总是多 resist 一点\" 的全局 bias。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Performance by Turn Depth (Commitment Depth)\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Method\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"Δ WRR (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.128, 0.652, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"R3-only\", 0.198, 0.568, \"+7.0 (DC better)\", \"+8.4 (DC better)\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.174, 0.598, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"R3-only\", 0.312, 0.512, \"+13.8 (DC better)\", \"+8.6 (DC better)\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.231, 0.541, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"R3-only\", 0.421, 0.463, \"+19.0 (DC better)\", \"+7.8 (DC better)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: Grouped bar chart。X 轴 = turn depth (2, 3, 4+)。每组两条 bar (DC-GRPO vs R3-only)。左面板 = NoF (越低越好)，右面板 = WRR (越高越好)。标注 Δ NoF 的递增趋势线。核心 message: DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 commitment 中放大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Turn-depth analysis 提供了 DC-GRPO 的多轮训练必要性论证：在 turn 2（浅层 commitment）\n      R3-only 的表现尚可（NoF 19.8%），但在 turn 4+（深层 commitment）急剧恶化至 42.1%。\n      DC-GRPO 的表征级信号在深层场景中提供了不可替代的价值。这直接回应了 \"multi-turn\n      contribution marginal vs single-turn\" 的审稿人质疑：单轮训练方法不会观察到这个\n      turn-depth 效应，因为它们没有深层 commitment 的训练信号。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-011: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      R1+R2（无 R3）ablation：去掉行为安全网后训练完整循环，观察是否出现表征-行为不一致。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.201\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.572\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.768\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.41\n      representation_behavior_misalignment_rate: 0.078\n      incoherent_output_rate: 0.034\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      R1+R2 无 R3 配置产生了有趣的结果：NoF 20.1% 优于 R3-only（30.5%）但略逊 DC-GRPO（17.2%），\n      WRR 57.2% 也相近但低于 DC-GRPO（60.3%）。关键发现是 MT-Bench 较大的降幅（7.41 vs DC-GRPO 7.65）\n      和 7.8% 的 representation-behavior misalignment rate。缺少 R3 行为约束后，模型偶尔学会\n      \"内部表征正确（低 d_syc 投影）但表面输出不连贯\" 的策略——R1 只奖励表征空间中的位置，\n      不直接约束输出文本质量。3.4% 的输出表现为明显 incoherent（如论证逻辑矛盾、突然切换立场\n      但没有合理过渡）。这些结果证实了 R3 行为安全网在 DC-GRPO 架构中的必要性：R1 提供方向\n      但 R3 确保方向优化不会以输出质量为代价。exp-009 (R1-only) 的 5pp 改进条件已满足\n      （R1-only NoF 22.8% 相对 R3-only 30.5% = 7.7pp > 5pp），所以此实验按计划执行。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Full Ablation Grid\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\", \"Misalign%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✓\", 0.172, 0.603, 0.831, 7.65, 0.012]\n          - [\"R1+R2 (no R3)\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✗\", 0.201, 0.572, 0.768, 7.41, 0.078]\n          - [\"R1-only\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✗\", 0.228, 0.538, 0.723, 7.52, 0.051]\n          - [\"R3-only\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"✓\", 0.305, 0.521, 0.670, 7.55, 0.008]\n          - [\"Vanilla\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"✗\", 0.451, 0.401, 0.482, 7.80, 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 Figure 7 ablation 图。增加一列 'Misalignment Rate' 条形图，展示缺少 R3 后的副作用。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此 ablation 完成了 reward component 的完整分解图。Misalignment rate 从 DC-GRPO 的 1.2%\n      升至 R1+R2-only 的 7.8%，量化了 R3 安全网的价值。论文叙事：\"R1 提供方向，R2 提供排序，\n      R3 提供行为约束——三者各有不可替代的角色。\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-012: cross_model_transfer\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"cross_model_transfer\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算、判别力和短程 DC-GRPO 训练。\n      Phase A: 方向计算 + AUROC。Phase B: ~3000 步 DC-GRPO 训练。\n    expected_results:\n      # Phase A\n      llama_auroc_200pairs: 0.843\n      llama_auroc_bootstrap_ci_lower: 0.812\n      llama_auroc_bootstrap_ci_upper: 0.871\n      llama_optimal_layer: 17\n      llama_layer_progression_similar: true\n      llama_direction_cosine_with_qwen: 0.231\n      # Phase B\n      llama_dc_grpo_nof: 0.223\n      llama_dc_grpo_wrr: 0.571\n      llama_dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.778\n      llama_r3_only_nof: 0.328\n      llama_r3_only_wrr: 0.508\n      llama_dc_grpo_vs_r3_nof_pp: 10.5\n      llama_dc_grpo_vs_r3_wrr_pp: 6.3\n      llama_dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.42\n      phase_a_gpu_hours: 4.8\n      phase_b_gpu_hours: 47.2\n      total_gpu_hours: 52.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase A：Llama-3-8B 的 AUROC 0.843 低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.891，但远超 0.75 gate 阈值，\n      确认 sycophancy 的线性表征方向是跨模型的普遍现象。最优层 L17（Llama 共 32 层 vs Qwen 32 层，\n      两者的 mid-layer 位置相当）。层级递进模式一致：early layers 随机，mid-layers 出现 emergence，\n      但 Llama 的 peak AUROC 稍低，可能因为 Llama 的 sycophancy 表征更分散（多个方向编码\n      sycophancy 的不同 facets，而非 Qwen 那样相对集中在单一方向）。\n      \n      Qwen 和 Llama 的 d_syc 方向 cosine similarity 仅 0.231——方向本身不跨模型迁移\n      （不同架构的表征空间不共享坐标系），但线性结构的存在性是共享的。这与 RepE 文献一致：\n      概念的线性编码是 transformer 架构的通用属性，但具体方向依赖于模型参数。\n      \n      Phase B：Llama 上的 DC-GRPO vs R3-only 差距（NoF -10.5pp, WRR +6.3pp）与 Qwen 上的\n      （NoF -13.3pp, WRR +8.2pp）方向一致但幅度稍小，合理——Llama 上 d_syc 判别力稍低\n      (0.843 vs 0.891)，R1 信号的 signal-to-noise 稍差。但改善幅度仍然显著，证明 DC-GRPO\n      框架跨模型有效。Phase B 仅训练 3000 步（vs Qwen 的 8000 步），尚未完全收敛，\n      实际差距可能更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Cross-Model Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen3-8B\", \"Llama-3-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d_syc AUROC (200 pairs)\", \"0.891\", \"0.843\"]\n          - [\"Optimal layer\", \"L19/32\", \"L17/32\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO NoF ↓\", \"0.172\", \"0.223\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO WRR ↑\", \"0.603\", \"0.571\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.831\", \"0.778\"]\n          - [\"R3-only NoF\", \"0.305\", \"0.328\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only Δ NoF (pp)\", \"-13.3\", \"-10.5\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only Δ WRR (pp)\", \"+8.2\", \"+6.3\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9a: 双模型 AUROC vs layer depth 对比折线图。Qwen (蓝) 和 Llama (橙)，层号归一化至 [0,1]（因两者共 32 层，实际也可直接对齐）。展示共同的 mid-layer emergence pattern。\"\n      - \"Figure 9b: 双模型 RC 曲线对比。每模型两条线 (DC-GRPO vs R3-only)，共 4 条曲线。展示 DC-GRPO 优势在两个模型上均成立。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model 结果落入 best 档（Llama AUROC 0.843 ∈ [0.8, 0.9]），有效回应 \"single model\"\n      审稿人质疑。论文可报告：\"sycophancy 的线性表征方向是跨模型族的普遍现象，DC-GRPO 框架无需\n      架构特定的适配即可迁移到新模型，仅需在目标模型上重新计算 d_syc 方向（~5 GPU 小时）。\"\n      方向 cosine 0.231 的低跨模型相似性反而是好消息——如果方向完全相同，可能暗示 d_syc\n      只是 trivial feature (如 text length)，而非 model-specific 认知表征。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-013: neutral_baseline_three_way\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"neutral_baseline_three_way\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      引入 neutral condition，计算独立 d_gen（与 d_syc 正交）。三方对比打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\n    expected_results:\n      d_syc_d_gen_cosine: 0.152\n      d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.821\n      r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof: 0.168\n      r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr: 0.618\n      wrr_improvement_over_rank_r2_pp: 1.5\n      neutral_pairs_generated: 60\n      gpu_hours_used: 4.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine similarity 0.152 证实两者近正交（远非 -1.0 的 degenerate 情况）。\n      这验证了 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 在表征空间中确实是不同的认知过程，而非同一轴的两端。\n      但实际训练改善有限：独立 d_gen R2 仅将 WRR 从 60.3% 提升至 61.8%（1.5pp），而 NoF\n      从 17.2% 微降至 16.8%。这说明 rank-based S1 设计已经足够好——它不依赖 d_gen 的具体\n      定义，只使用 sycophancy 和 revision 的相对排序。独立 d_gen 的主要价值是理论上的：\n      它证明 R2 可以被进一步改进，但当前 S1 设计的近似已足够实用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (appendix): Three-Way Directional Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Direction Pair\", \"Cosine Similarity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_gen (binary)\", \"-0.892 (near anti-parallel, as expected)\"]\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_gen (three-way)\", \"0.152 (near orthogonal)\"]\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_neutral\", \"-0.321\"]\n          - [\"d_gen vs d_neutral\", \"-0.287\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: 3D PCA 散点图，sycophantic (红) / genuine revision (蓝) / neutral (灰) 三类 activations，标注 d_syc 和 d_gen 方向向量。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三方设计确认了 d_syc 和 d_gen 的独立性（cosine 0.152），但训练改善有限。\n      建议放入 appendix 作为 \"R2 design validation\"，而非主文方法更新。\n      论文可写：\"While binary contrastive design (d_gen ≈ -d_syc) is a known limitation,\n      three-way validation shows d_gen is nearly orthogonal to d_syc (cos θ = 0.15),\n      and rank-based R2 already captures this without explicit d_gen computation.\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-014: continuous_probe_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"continuous_probe_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      Continuous Probe Baseline：logistic regression 概率值（非 binary 输出）作为 R1 替代。\n      隔离 \"方向性 vs 连续性\" 对 DC-GRPO 优势的贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.231\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.018\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.562\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.020\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.748\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.60\n      mmlu_mean: 0.617\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.283\n      probe_calibration_ece: 0.043\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_pp: 5.9\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_wrr_pp: 4.1\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rc_auc_diff: 0.083\n      continuous_probe_vs_binary_probe_nof_pp: 2.3\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Continuous Probe 是本研究最关键的 ablation baseline——它直接回答 \"DC-GRPO 优于 Binary Probe\n      是因为方向几何性，还是仅仅因为连续信号？\"。Logistic regression 在同一 calibration data 上\n      训练，输出 p(sycophantic|activation) ∈ [0,1] 作为 R1 替代。\n      \n      结果：Continuous Probe NoF 23.1% vs Binary Probe 25.4%（改善 2.3pp），证实连续信号\n      确实比 binary 信号更好（提供了 gradient-friendly 的 reward landscape）。但 DC-GRPO 的\n      NoF 17.2% vs Continuous Probe 23.1%（差 5.9pp, p=0.013），证明方向性提供了连续性之外的\n      额外信息。\n      \n      信息分解：Binary → Continuous 改善 2.3pp（连续性贡献），Continuous → DC-GRPO 改善 5.9pp\n      （方向性贡献）。方向性贡献 (5.9pp) > 连续性贡献 (2.3pp)，比值 2.6:1。\n      \n      机制解释：Logistic regression 概率 p(syc) 是一个标量，告诉优化器 \"当前 activation 有多 sycophantic\"，\n      但不告诉 \"沿哪个方向修改 activation 最有效\"。它提供了 magnitude 信息但缺少 direction 信息。\n      DC-GRPO 的 d_syc 投影 dot(a, d_syc) 同时提供 magnitude（投影长度）和 direction（d_syc 方向），\n      使得 LoRA 参数更新可以精确瞄准 sycophancy 表征方向，而非在整个 activation 空间中 \"盲搜\"\n      降低 p(syc) 的路径。这解释了为什么 AUROC 接近（两者都 ~0.88-0.89）但训练效果差距显著——\n      分类准确度不等于梯度效率。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Continuity vs Directionality Decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Transition\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"Contribution Type\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Binary Probe → Continuous Probe\", \"-2.3\", \"Continuity\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe → DC-GRPO\", \"-5.9\", \"Directionality\"]\n          - [\"Total: Binary Probe → DC-GRPO\", \"-8.2\", \"Combined\"]\n      - name: \"Table 16: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Detailed\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Continuous Probe\", \"DC-GRPO\", \"Δ\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF ↓\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.172 ± 0.014\", \"-5.9pp\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.562 ± 0.020\", \"0.603 ± 0.018\", \"+4.1pp\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.748 ± 0.014\", \"0.831 ± 0.015\", \"+0.083\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"MT-Bench\", \"7.60\", \"7.65\", \"+0.05\", \"0.412 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: 信息分解 waterfall chart。从 Binary Probe NoF (25.4%) 出发，-2.3pp (continuity, 蓝) 到 Continuous Probe (23.1%)，再 -5.9pp (directionality, 橙) 到 DC-GRPO (17.2%)。清晰展示方向性 > 连续性。\"\n      - \"纳入 Figure 3 RC 曲线，Continuous Probe 位于 Binary Probe 和 DC-GRPO 之间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文最重要的 ablation 结果。5.9pp 方向性贡献 vs 2.3pp 连续性贡献的 2.6:1 比值\n      直接支撑核心叙事：\"方向几何性（而非仅连续性）为训练提供了不可替代的梯度优势。\"\n      Continuous Probe 的 ECE 0.043 说明其概率校准良好，排除了 \"连续信号质量差\" 的替代解释。\n      论文可直接写：\"Even when the continuous probe is well-calibrated (ECE=0.043),\n      directional projection outperforms it by 5.9pp on NoF (p=0.013), demonstrating\n      that the geometric structure of d_syc provides gradient information beyond what\n      scalar probability estimates can offer.\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-015: reward_weight_sensitivity\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"reward_weight_sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: >\n      测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 权重配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\n      从 exp-002 step 4000 checkpoint 分叉短程训练。\n    expected_results:\n      configs_tested: 5\n      config_default:\n        weights: [0.3, 0.2, 0.5]\n        nof: 0.172\n        wrr: 0.603\n        rc_auc: 0.831\n      config_r1_dominant:\n        weights: [0.6, 0.1, 0.3]\n        nof: 0.158\n        wrr: 0.561\n        rc_auc: 0.802\n      config_r3_dominant:\n        weights: [0.15, 0.15, 0.7]\n        nof: 0.241\n        wrr: 0.548\n        rc_auc: 0.742\n      config_r1_r3_swap:\n        weights: [0.5, 0.2, 0.3]\n        nof: 0.163\n        wrr: 0.578\n        rc_auc: 0.818\n      config_equal:\n        weights: [0.33, 0.33, 0.34]\n        nof: 0.182\n        wrr: 0.592\n        rc_auc: 0.821\n      nof_range_across_configs_pp: 2.4\n      wrr_range_across_configs_pp: 4.2\n      rc_auc_range_across_configs: 0.089\n      all_configs_beat_r3_only_nof: true\n      all_configs_beat_r3_only_wrr: true\n      optimal_config: \"default [0.3, 0.2, 0.5]\"\n      gpu_hours_used: 14.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      5 组权重配置中，NoF 范围仅 2.4pp（15.8%-24.1%），排除 R3-dominant 后仅 2.4pp（15.8%-18.2%）。\n      所有配置均显著优于 R3-only（30.5%），最弱的 R3-dominant 配置（24.1%）仍比 R3-only 好 6.4pp。\n      \n      模式清晰：R1 权重越高 → NoF 越低但 WRR 也越低（模型更 \"固执\"）。R3 权重越高 → NoF 越高但\n      输出更连贯。默认配置 [0.3, 0.2, 0.5] 在 RC-AUC 上最优（0.831），因为它在 NoF 和 WRR 之间\n      取得了最佳平衡。R1-dominant [0.6, 0.1, 0.3] 达到最低 NoF（0.158）但 WRR 降至 0.561，\n      RC-AUC 0.802。\n      \n      关键结论：DC-GRPO 对权重选择不敏感——任何合理的权重配置（只要 R1 > 0 且 R3 > 0）\n      都显著优于 R3-only。这消除了 \"权重选择需要昂贵调参\" 的实用性质疑。NoF 范围 2.4pp\n      落入 best 档 [1.0, 3.0]。\n      \n      R3-dominant 配置表现最差，因为 R3 权重过高 (0.7) 使得 R1 的方向信号被稀释，\n      训练回退接近 R3-only 的行为。但即使如此 (NoF 24.1%) 仍显著好于 R3-only (30.5%)，\n      说明即使微弱的 R1 信号也有价值。Equal weight 配置 (0.33, 0.33, 0.34) 表现接近默认\n      (NoF 18.2% vs 17.2%)，说明 \"不调参直接均分\" 也是可行的 default。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 17: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis (from step 4000 checkpoint, +3000 steps each)\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"w1 (R1)\", \"w2 (R2)\", \"w3 (R3)\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Default\", 0.3, 0.2, 0.5, 0.172, 0.603, 0.831]\n          - [\"R1-dominant\", 0.6, 0.1, 0.3, 0.158, 0.561, 0.802]\n          - [\"R1-R3 swap\", 0.5, 0.2, 0.3, 0.163, 0.578, 0.818]\n          - [\"Equal\", 0.33, 0.33, 0.34, 0.182, 0.592, 0.821]\n          - [\"R3-dominant\", 0.15, 0.15, 0.7, 0.241, 0.548, 0.742]\n          - [\"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (ref)\", 0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.305, 0.521, 0.670]\n      - name: \"Table 18: Sensitivity Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Range across 5 configs\", \"All beat R3-only?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF\", \"2.4pp (15.8%–24.1%)\", \"Yes (worst: 24.1% vs 30.5%)\"]\n          - [\"WRR\", \"4.2pp (56.1%–60.3%)\", \"Yes (worst: 54.8% vs 52.1%)\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC\", \"0.089 (0.742–0.831)\", \"Yes (worst: 0.742 vs 0.670)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: 散点图，X 轴 = w1 (R1 weight), Y 轴 = NoF (左面板) / WRR (右面板)。5 个配置点 + R3-only 参考线。展示 R1 权重与 NoF 的负相关、与 WRR 的微弱负相关，以及所有点均在 R3-only 参考线之上。\"\n    analysis: >\n      权重敏感度分析消除了 \"DC-GRPO 结果依赖精心调参\" 的质疑。NoF 范围 2.4pp 远小于\n      DC-GRPO vs R3-only 的 13.3pp 差距，说明方法本身（而非特定权重选择）是改善的来源。\n      论文可报告：\"DC-GRPO is robust to reward weight selection: all tested configurations\n      significantly outperform R3-only, with NoF varying by only 2.4pp across a wide range\n      of weight ratios.\" 默认配置 [0.3, 0.2, 0.5] 可作为推荐 default，无需 per-task tuning。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11886,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11886},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3bfac684-94a2-428c-a471-98b614f0598f","uuid":"3491fcd3-3727-495e-9dcf-7255ccdf6c65"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":454577,"duration_api_ms":455886,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Title 可直接用 'Direction-Contrastive GRPO Breaks the Sycophancy-Revision Double-Bind'。\n  三条 Claims 均作为正面结果报告：(1) d_syc 编码多轮认知信号，(2) DC-GRPO 利用该信号实现 double-bind 解耦，\n  (3) R1-R3 disagreement 揭示 masked sycophancy 的存在。Continuous Probe 对比清晰证明方向几何优于标量概率。\n  Binary Probe 和 ACT 均被显著击败。论文核心叙事：'表征空间的方向结构为训练提供了行为信号无法提供的梯度信息'。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-001: calibration_data_expansion\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"calibration_data_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong evidence_strength），\n      重新计算 d_syc 方向，5-fold CV + bootstrap CI 评估 AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      auroc_200pairs_cv_mean: 0.891\n      auroc_200pairs_cv_std: 0.023\n      auroc_bootstrap_95ci_lower: 0.862\n      auroc_bootstrap_95ci_upper: 0.918\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak: 0.841\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium: 0.903\n      auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong: 0.942\n      auroc_layer_0: 0.518\n      auroc_layer_8: 0.614\n      auroc_layer_12: 0.723\n      auroc_layer_16: 0.825\n      auroc_layer_19: 0.891\n      auroc_layer_24: 0.883\n      auroc_layer_27: 0.874\n      optimal_layer: 19\n      direction_norm: 1.0\n      data_generation_cost_usd: 14.50\n      gpu_hours_used: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      MVP 的 50 pairs 全 weak evidence 达到 AUROC 0.826（σ=0.054）。扩展至 200 pairs 带来两重增益：\n      (a) 4× 数据量使 PCA 方向估计方差降低约 √4 = 2×，CV 标准差从 0.054 缩至 ~0.023；\n      (b) medium/strong evidence pairs 提供更清晰的 sycophancy vs revision 对比，让 d_syc 方向\n      捕获到更纯粹的认知信号而非 hedging 策略差异。weak evidence 子集 AUROC 0.841 略低于 overall 0.891，\n      因为 weak evidence 场景中 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 的内部表征更接近（模型自身不确定性更高，\n      正当修正和谄媚让步的认知差距更小）。strong evidence 场景中模型内部对 \"事实明确但仍让步\" 有清晰的\n      表征区分，AUROC 达 0.942。层级递进模式与 MVP 一致：L0 随机，L16 起出现 emergence（mid-layer\n      factual assessment 编码），L19 峰值，L24-27 略微回落（高层更多编码 output formatting 而非认知状态）。\n      evidence_strength 的分层效应直接反驳 \"d_syc 只是 style detector\" 的质疑——如果方向仅编码风格，\n      三个 evidence strength 条件（风格已控制）不应出现系统性 AUROC 差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: d_syc Discriminability by Evidence Strength (200 pairs, 5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [\"Evidence Strength\", \"N pairs\", \"AUROC (mean±std)\", \"Bootstrap 95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Weak\", 80, \"0.841 ± 0.031\", \"[0.802, 0.878]\"]\n          - [\"Medium\", 60, \"0.903 ± 0.025\", \"[0.869, 0.935]\"]\n          - [\"Strong\", 60, \"0.942 ± 0.019\", \"[0.916, 0.966]\"]\n          - [\"All (pooled)\", 200, \"0.891 ± 0.023\", \"[0.862, 0.918]\"]\n      - name: \"Table 2: AUROC by Extraction Layer\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"AUROC\", \"Δ vs L0\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", 0.518, \"—\"]\n          - [\"L8\", 0.614, \"+0.096\"]\n          - [\"L12\", 0.723, \"+0.205\"]\n          - [\"L16\", 0.825, \"+0.307\"]\n          - [\"L19 (peak)\", 0.891, \"+0.373\"]\n          - [\"L24\", 0.883, \"+0.365\"]\n          - [\"L27\", 0.874, \"+0.356\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1a: AUROC vs layer depth 折线图，标注 L16 emergence point 和 L19 peak。三条线分别对应 weak/medium/strong evidence strength，展示 mid-layer convergence 后 strong > medium > weak 的分层。\"\n      - \"Figure 1b: 200 pairs 的 2D PCA 投影散点图（L19 activations），sycophantic capitulation (红) vs genuine revision (蓝)，按 evidence_strength 标注 marker shape (circle/triangle/square)。展示线性可分性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC 0.891 远超 STOP-gate 阈值 0.80，落入 best 档 [0.87, 0.93]。全速推进 exp-002。\n      evidence_strength 分层是最关键的新发现：weak/medium/strong 的 AUROC 梯度 (0.841 → 0.903 → 0.942)\n      直接支撑 Claim 1 的 \"认知信号\" 论述。在风格已控制的前提下，evidence 越强 d_syc 判别力越高，\n      说明方向编码的是模型对 evidence 的内部评估，而非表面语言特征。这为 Discussion 中 \"d_syc 捕获\n      factual assessment mechanism\" 提供了最直接的证据。bootstrap CI 足够窄（±0.028），论文可报告\n      统计显著的分层效应（weak vs strong p < 0.001, permutation test）。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-002: dc_grpo_main\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"dc_grpo_main\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)。\n      Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds，8000 步，每 500 步重校准 d_syc。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.172\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.014\n      sycon_tof_mean: 0.828\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.603\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.018\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.172\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.831\n      rc_auc_std: 0.015\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.65\n      mt_bench_std: 0.08\n      mmlu_mean: 0.618\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.218\n      training_steps_actual: 8000\n      early_stop_triggered: false\n      best_checkpoint_step: 7000\n      convergence_step_approx: 5500\n      gpu_hours_used: 52.3\n      r1_weight: 0.3\n      r2_weight: 0.2\n      r3_weight: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      DC-GRPO 的核心优势在于 R1 提供了 R3 无法获取的梯度信息。R3（NLI behavioral）只能评估最终输出\n      是否与 ground truth 一致，对 \"表面正确但内部已谄媚\" 的情况完全盲目。R1 通过 d_syc 投影直接\n      读取模型内部的认知状态，能在模型即将走向 sycophantic capitulation 但尚未在表面显现时提供负梯度。\n      这使得 DC-GRPO 在保持 WRR 的同时大幅降低 NoF：R1 告诉优化器 \"这个 revision 的内部动机是谄媚\n      而非认知更新\"，R3 确认 \"这个 resistance 的表面输出是合理的\"，两者协同实现了 double-bind 解耦。\n      NoF 17.2% 对应相对 vanilla (45%) 的 62% 降幅，同时 WRR 60.3% 表明模型并未变得顽固——\n      当 evidence 确实支持修正时，模型仍然修正。RC-AUC 0.831 远超 R3-only 的 0.67，捕获了\n      capitulation-revision tradeoff 曲线下的大面积改善。MT-Bench 7.65 相对 vanilla 7.80\n      仅降 0.15，在可接受范围内（对话能力未被显著破坏）。训练在 ~5500 步收敛，8000 步完整跑完无\n      early stop，最优 checkpoint 在 step 7000（最后阶段 RC-AUC 微小波动）。R2 rank-based\n      contrastive 奖励提供了 sycophancy-revision 的序关系梯度，避免了 binary reward 的梯度稀疏问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics at Key Checkpoints (seed average)\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\", \"R1-R3 Agree%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1000, 0.361, 0.478, 0.612, 7.72, 0.834]\n          - [2000, 0.289, 0.521, 0.689, 7.70, 0.862]\n          - [4000, 0.218, 0.571, 0.783, 7.68, 0.878]\n          - [6000, 0.185, 0.594, 0.819, 7.66, 0.883]\n          - [7000, 0.172, 0.603, 0.831, 7.65, 0.886]\n          - [8000, 0.176, 0.601, 0.828, 7.64, 0.884]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2a: 训练曲线——NoF 和 WRR 随 training step 的变化，3 seeds 的 mean ± std band。标注 d_syc 重校准点 (每 500 步垂直虚线)。\"\n      - \"Figure 2b: RC-AUC 训练曲线 vs R3-only baseline (exp-003) 的对比，展示 DC-GRPO 在 ~step 2000 后拉开差距。\"\n      - \"Figure 2c: Revision-Capitulation 曲线（类 ROC）——DC-GRPO vs R3-only vs vanilla，展示 DC-GRPO 在各操作点上的帕累托优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DC-GRPO 三个 seed 的结果高度一致（NoF std 0.014, RC-AUC std 0.015），说明方法稳健。\n      训练动态显示 R1 信号在 step 1000-4000 期间贡献最大——这正是模型从 \"全面抵抗\" 过渡到\n      \"选择性抵抗\" 的关键阶段。step 7000 后 RC-AUC 微降，可能因 LoRA 过拟合训练分布的特定\n      resistance pattern，但幅度极小。MMLU 维持 61.8%，与 vanilla 的 62.1% 无显著差异，\n      说明 LoRA rank 64 + 方向奖励的组合未损害模型通用能力。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-003: r3_only_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"r3_only_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      R3-only GRPO baseline（仅 NLI behavioral reward），复现 \"Pressure, What Pressure?\" 思路。\n      同等训练配置，3 seeds。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.305\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.019\n      sycon_tof_mean: 0.695\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.521\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.021\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.305\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.670\n      rc_auc_std: 0.018\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.55\n      mt_bench_std: 0.09\n      mmlu_mean: 0.616\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.348\n      training_steps_actual: 8000\n      gpu_hours_used: 33.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      R3-only 训练的根本限制是 double-bind：NLI 行为奖励无法区分 \"用户错误但模型让步\"（sycophancy）\n      和 \"用户正确但模型仍抵抗\"（stubbornness）。R3 对两种情况给出相同的负/正信号——它只看\n      最终答案是否正确，不看模型为什么改变或不改变。结果是 R3-only 在降低 NoF 的同时必然压低 WRR：\n      模型学到 \"不改变答案总是更安全的\"，因为在训练分布中 sycophantic capitulation 比 warranted\n      revision 更频繁，\"抵抗\" 的期望奖励更高。NoF 30.5% 相对 vanilla 45% 已有改善，但 WRR 52.1%\n      说明模型变得过于保守——在应该修正时也倾向于坚持原答案。RC-AUC 0.670 反映了这个 tradeoff\n      的劣质：capitulation-revision 曲线在中间区域严重凹陷。MT-Bench 7.55 略低于 DC-GRPO 的 7.65，\n      因为 R3-only 的 \"全面抵抗\" 策略偶尔在正常对话中也表现为不必要的固执，影响对话流畅度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (for exp-005 consolidation): R3-only Checkpoint Progression\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [2000, 0.378, 0.492, 0.578]\n          - [4000, 0.331, 0.512, 0.632]\n          - [6000, 0.310, 0.519, 0.661]\n          - [8000, 0.305, 0.521, 0.670]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 exp-002 合并展示（Figure 2b/2c），R3-only 作为主 baseline 出现在所有对比图中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R3-only 是 DC-GRPO 最关键的 baseline。13.3pp NoF 差距（30.5% vs 17.2%）和 8.2pp WRR 差距\n      （52.1% vs 60.3%）清晰证明 representation-level reward 的附加值。关键观察：R3-only 在 step 4000\n      后改善速度急剧放缓（NoF 仅从 33.1% 降至 30.5%），而 DC-GRPO 在同期仍有显著下降（21.8% → 17.2%），\n      说明 R1 提供的梯度信息在训练后期尤其重要——此时行为奖励的 signal-to-noise 已经很低。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-004: act_style_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"act_style_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline。Clean/biased prompt 对上施加 L2 activation\n      consistency loss，不区分 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 方向。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.281\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.022\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.483\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.025\n      unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean: 0.281\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.601\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.48\n      mmlu_mean: 0.613\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.321\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACT 施加无差别的 activation consistency——要求模型在 clean（无 user pressure）和 biased（有 pressure）\n      条件下产生相同的 hidden states。这比 R3-only 更直接地作用于表征层，所以 NoF 28.1% 略优于 R3-only 的\n      30.5%。但 ACT 的致命缺陷是它惩罚所有 activation 变化，包括对合理论据的正常认知更新。模型在接收到\n      有效反驳后的正常 \"重新评估\" 过程会产生 activation 变化，ACT 将其等同于 sycophantic pressure 下的\n      activation 变化一并惩罚。结果是 WRR 48.3%，甚至低于 R3-only 的 52.1%——ACT 训练出的模型\n      \"activation 冻结\" 策略使它在应该修正时也保持 activations 不变，从而拒绝修正。RC-AUC 0.601 是\n      所有训练方法中最低的（甚至低于 R3-only 的 0.670），因为 RC 曲线在 high-revision-rate 端\n      急剧恶化。MT-Bench 7.48 的较大降幅进一步印证：undifferentiated consistency 约束限制了模型\n      在正常对话中根据新信息调整回答的能力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (for exp-005 consolidation): ACT Baseline Results\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SYCON NoF ↓\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.483 ± 0.025\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.601\"]\n          - [\"MT-Bench\", \"7.48\"]\n          - [\"SycophancyEval Rate ↓\", \"0.321\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"与 exp-005 合并。ACT 在 RC 曲线图 (Figure 3) 中展示其特征性的 'low-ceiling' 模式——在 WRR 超过 ~0.50 后曲线急剧恶化。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACT 的结果精准诊断了 undifferentiated consistency 的失败模式：它在 sycophancy 维度上的改善被\n      revision 维度上的退化完全抵消。这为 DC-GRPO 的方向性方法提供了最强的正面论据——同样是\n      activation-level 信号，方向性 (d_syc projection) vs 无差别 (L2 consistency) 的差异导致\n      RC-AUC 从 0.601 跃升至 0.831。论文可以用 ACT 作为 \"方向性是关键\" 的反面教材。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-005: full_evaluation\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"full_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的综合评估。SYCON Bench, SycophancyEval, MT-Bench, MMLU。\n      加上 WRR, UCR, RC-AUC, Turn-depth 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # DC-GRPO\n      dc_grpo_sycon_nof: 0.172\n      dc_grpo_wrr: 0.603\n      dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.831\n      dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.65\n      dc_grpo_mmlu: 0.618\n      dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval: 0.218\n      # R3-only\n      r3_only_sycon_nof: 0.305\n      r3_only_wrr: 0.521\n      r3_only_rc_auc: 0.670\n      r3_only_mt_bench: 7.55\n      r3_only_mmlu: 0.616\n      r3_only_sycophancy_eval: 0.348\n      # ACT\n      act_sycon_nof: 0.281\n      act_wrr: 0.483\n      act_rc_auc: 0.601\n      act_mt_bench: 7.48\n      act_mmlu: 0.613\n      act_sycophancy_eval: 0.321\n      # Binary Probe\n      binary_probe_sycon_nof: 0.254\n      binary_probe_wrr: 0.542\n      binary_probe_rc_auc: 0.712\n      binary_probe_mt_bench: 7.58\n      binary_probe_mmlu: 0.617\n      binary_probe_sycophancy_eval: 0.301\n      # Continuous Probe\n      continuous_probe_sycon_nof: 0.231\n      continuous_probe_wrr: 0.562\n      continuous_probe_rc_auc: 0.748\n      continuous_probe_mt_bench: 7.60\n      continuous_probe_mmlu: 0.617\n      continuous_probe_sycophancy_eval: 0.283\n      # Vanilla\n      vanilla_sycon_nof: 0.451\n      vanilla_wrr: 0.401\n      vanilla_rc_auc: 0.482\n      vanilla_mt_bench: 7.80\n      vanilla_mmlu: 0.621\n      vanilla_sycophancy_eval: 0.553\n      # Statistical significance (DC-GRPO vs R3-only, paired bootstrap)\n      nof_diff_p_value: 0.0003\n      wrr_diff_p_value: 0.0018\n      rc_auc_diff_p_value: 0.0001\n      # DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\n      nof_vs_binary_probe_p_value: 0.0042\n      # DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\n      nof_vs_continuous_probe_p_value: 0.0127\n      gpu_hours_used: 13.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      综合评估的核心发现：DC-GRPO 在所有 sycophancy-related 指标上显著优于所有 baseline，同时\n      通用能力 (MT-Bench, MMLU) 保持在可接受范围内。\n      \n      关键对比梯度（NoF 由低到高）：DC-GRPO (17.2%) < Continuous Probe (23.1%) < Binary Probe (25.4%)\n      < ACT (28.1%) < R3-only (30.5%) < Vanilla (45.1%)。这个梯度精确对应了方法的信息丰富度：\n      方向投影 > 连续概率 > 二值分类 > 无差别一致性 > 纯行为。\n      \n      WRR 梯度同样有序：DC-GRPO (60.3%) > Continuous Probe (56.2%) > Binary Probe (54.2%)\n      > R3-only (52.1%) > ACT (48.3%) > Vanilla (40.1%)。注意 ACT 的 WRR 甚至低于 R3-only，\n      因为 activation freezing 策略同时抑制了合理的 revision。\n      \n      RC-AUC 综合了 NoF 和 WRR 的 tradeoff，DC-GRPO 的 0.831 vs R3-only 的 0.670 是最关键的\n      headline number——16.1pp 差距，p < 0.001。\n      \n      SycophancyEval 结果与 SYCON 趋势一致但绝对值更高，因为 SycophancyEval 包含单轮场景\n      （DC-GRPO 的多轮优势在此稍被稀释）。MT-Bench 降幅呈现与 sycophancy 改善的 weak tradeoff：\n      DC-GRPO 7.65 (-0.15) vs ACT 7.48 (-0.32)，说明方向性方法比无差别约束更精准，对通用对话\n      能力的副作用更小。MMLU 几乎无变化（所有方法 61.3-62.1%），LoRA 训练未破坏 factual knowledge。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Main Results — Sycophancy-Revision Metrics (SYCON Bench, mean ± std over 3 seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"UCR ↓\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vanilla Qwen3-8B\", \"0.451\", \"0.401\", \"0.451\", \"0.482\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (behavioral GRPO)\", \"0.305 ± 0.019\", \"0.521 ± 0.021\", \"0.305 ± 0.019\", \"0.670 ± 0.018\"]\n          - [\"ACT-style consistency\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\", \"0.483 ± 0.025\", \"0.281 ± 0.022\", \"0.601\"]\n          - [\"Binary Probe Penalty\", \"0.254 ± 0.020\", \"0.542 ± 0.022\", \"0.254 ± 0.020\", \"0.712 ± 0.016\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe (ours)\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.562 ± 0.020\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.748 ± 0.014\"]\n          - [\"**DC-GRPO (ours)**\", \"**0.172 ± 0.014**\", \"**0.603 ± 0.018**\", \"**0.172 ± 0.014**\", \"**0.831 ± 0.015**\"]\n      - name: \"Table 5: General Capability Preservation\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"MT-Bench ↑\", \"Δ MT-Bench\", \"MMLU ↑\", \"SycophancyEval Rate ↓\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vanilla Qwen3-8B\", 7.80, \"—\", \"62.1%\", \"55.3%\"]\n          - [\"R3-only\", 7.55, \"-0.25\", \"61.6%\", \"34.8%\"]\n          - [\"ACT-style\", 7.48, \"-0.32\", \"61.3%\", \"32.1%\"]\n          - [\"Binary Probe\", 7.58, \"-0.22\", \"61.7%\", \"30.1%\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe\", 7.60, \"-0.20\", \"61.7%\", \"28.3%\"]\n          - [\"**DC-GRPO**\", \"**7.65**\", \"**-0.15**\", \"**61.8%**\", \"**21.8%**\"]\n      - name: \"Table 6: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, 10000 resamples)\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Δ WRR (pp)\", \"p-value\", \"Δ RC-AUC\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only\", \"-13.3\", \"<0.001\", \"+8.2\", \"0.002\", \"+0.161\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs ACT\", \"-10.9\", \"<0.001\", \"+12.0\", \"<0.001\", \"+0.230\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\", \"-8.2\", \"0.004\", \"+6.1\", \"0.009\", \"+0.119\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\", \"-5.9\", \"0.013\", \"+4.1\", \"0.031\", \"+0.083\", \"0.003\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Revision-Capitulation 曲线（主结果图）。X 轴 = Warranted Revision Rate, Y 轴 = 1 - NoF (Capitulation Resistance Rate)。每个方法一条曲线（通过调节 decision threshold 产生），DC-GRPO 帕累托支配所有 baseline。曲线下面积即 RC-AUC。\"\n      - \"Figure 4: 雷达图/条形图，6 个方法在 NoF / WRR / RC-AUC / MT-Bench / SycophancyEval 5 个维度上的对比，突出 DC-GRPO 的全面优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      主结果表 (Table 4) 是论文的核心。方法梯度 DC-GRPO > Continuous Probe > Binary Probe > ACT > R3-only\n      构成了清晰的 ablation 阶梯：方向投影 > 连续概率 > 二值分类 > 无差别一致性 > 纯行为。\n      DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe 的 5.9pp NoF 差距（p=0.013）直接证明 \"方向几何性（非仅连续性）是关键\"。\n      所有统计检验通过，论文可以自信报告所有 pairwise 比较的显著性。RC-AUC 作为综合指标提供了最清晰的\n      单数字对比：DC-GRPO 0.831 vs R3-only 0.670，16.1pp 差距。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-006: direction_stability_monitoring\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"direction_stability_monitoring\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      DC-GRPO 训练中 d_syc 方向稳定性监控：每 500 步重校准，报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_step_0: 1.000\n      cosine_sim_step_500: 0.961\n      cosine_sim_step_1000: 0.938\n      cosine_sim_step_2000: 0.912\n      cosine_sim_step_3000: 0.901\n      cosine_sim_step_4000: 0.893\n      cosine_sim_step_5000: 0.889\n      cosine_sim_step_6000: 0.885\n      cosine_sim_step_7000: 0.878\n      cosine_sim_step_8000: 0.872\n      cosine_min_across_training: 0.872\n      cosine_mean_across_training: 0.912\n      held_out_auroc_step_0: 0.891\n      held_out_auroc_step_4000: 0.876\n      held_out_auroc_step_8000: 0.863\n      drift_rate_per_1000_steps: 0.016\n      recalibration_trigger_count: 0\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 方向在训练过程中缓慢漂移但保持高度稳定，min cosine 0.872 远超 0.7 重校准阈值，\n      从未触发额外重校准。漂移模式是单调递减的：前 2000 步漂移较快（cosine 从 1.0 降至 0.912），\n      因为 LoRA 参数在此期间变化最大（学习率 warmup 后的快速适应期）；后 6000 步趋于平稳\n      （0.912 → 0.872），因为模型已基本收敛，表征空间的结构性调整减小。\n      \n      这个稳定性有两个关键含义：(1) 实用层面，每 500 步重校准的 overhead 已足够，无需更频繁的\n      更新，这降低了 DC-GRPO 的实际部署复杂度；(2) 理论层面，d_syc 方向的稳定性暗示 sycophancy\n      表征空间的线性结构在 LoRA 微调下具有不变性——LoRA 修改了模型行为但未根本改变\n      sycophancy/revision 的表征几何。held-out AUROC 从 0.891 缓降至 0.863（-0.028），\n      说明训练改变了 activation 分布但线性判别面仍然有效。这间接支撑了 RepE 的核心假设：\n      高级语义概念的线性表征是模型架构的结构性属性，而非特定参数配置的偶然产物。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Direction Stability During DC-GRPO Training\"\n        columns: [\"Step\", \"Cosine w/ Initial d_syc\", \"Held-out AUROC\", \"Cumulative Drift\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0, 1.000, 0.891, 0.000]\n          - [1000, 0.938, 0.885, 0.062]\n          - [2000, 0.912, 0.880, 0.088]\n          - [4000, 0.893, 0.876, 0.107]\n          - [6000, 0.885, 0.870, 0.115]\n          - [8000, 0.872, 0.863, 0.128]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: 双 Y 轴折线图。左 Y 轴 = cosine similarity with initial d_syc (蓝线)，右 Y 轴 = held-out AUROC (橙线)。X 轴 = training step。标注 0.7 cosine threshold（远低于观测值）和 0.80 AUROC threshold（也远低于观测值）。展示方向的高稳定性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      min cosine 0.872 落入 best 档 [0.85, 0.95]。方向稳定性结论强有力：无需频繁重校准。\n      这是实用性的关键论点——如果 d_syc 在训练中剧烈漂移，DC-GRPO 的 R1 奖励会变得不可靠，\n      需要复杂的 online recalibration 机制。实际结果表明 500 步重校准周期绑定稳健，\n      甚至可以进一步放宽。论文可以报告 \"direction is a stable property of the representation\n      space, not an artifact of specific model parameters\"。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-007: r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      分析 DC-GRPO 训练中 R1 (方向投影) 和 R3 (NLI behavioral) 给出不同信号的频率和模式。\n      重点关注 R1-high/R3-low (masked sycophancy) 案例。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_disagreement_rate: 0.121\n      r1_high_r3_low_rate: 0.088\n      r1_low_r3_high_rate: 0.033\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2: 0.074\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3: 0.132\n      disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus: 0.178\n      disagreement_by_evidence_weak: 0.153\n      disagreement_by_evidence_medium: 0.112\n      disagreement_by_evidence_strong: 0.081\n      masked_sycophancy_example_count: 247\n      qualitative_categories_count: 4\n      category_1_surface_correct_internal_syc: 0.41\n      category_2_hedging_disguised_capitulation: 0.28\n      category_3_partial_revision_full_internal_shift: 0.19\n      category_4_noise_ambiguous: 0.12\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      12.1% overall disagreement rate 远超 5% 阈值，Claim 3 获得强有力的定量支撑。\n      \n      R1-high/R3-low（masked sycophancy）占 disagreement 的 73%（8.8% / 12.1%），远多于\n      R1-low/R3-high 的 27%。这个不对称性很有意义：masked sycophancy（内部已谄媚但表面\n      输出仍正确）比反面情况（内部正常但表面看起来 sycophantic）更常见。这与 Knowledge-Prediction\n      Gap 文献中 13-29% 的 representation-behavioral disagreement 估计一致。\n      \n      Turn depth 的单调递增效应（7.4% → 13.2% → 17.8%）是最重要的发现之一：随着对话轮次\n      增加，模型在 commitment 加深后更容易在表面维持正确答案但内部已经发生 sycophantic shift。\n      这直接对应 TRUTH DECAY 论文中描述的 \"accuracy degradation over turns\" 机制，但我们首次\n      在表征层面量化了这个过程：模型不是突然 capitulate，而是逐渐在内部 shift 后最终在某个\n      turn 表面也 break。R1 能在表面 break 之前 1-2 turns 检测到这个内部 shift。\n      \n      evidence strength 的反向梯度（weak 15.3% > medium 11.2% > strong 8.1%）也合理：\n      在 weak evidence 场景下，sycophancy 和 genuine uncertainty 的行为表面更难区分，\n      R3 更容易被 \"骗过\"，而 R1 通过表征维度仍能区分。\n      \n      四个定性类别的分布说明 masked sycophancy 不是单一现象：最常见的是 \"表面正确但内部\n      已 sycophantically recalibrate confidence\"（41%），其次是 \"hedging 语言掩饰实质性让步\"\n      （28%），第三是 \"partial revision 掩饰 full internal belief shift\"（19%），\n      最后 12% 是噪声/模糊案例。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: R1-R3 Disagreement Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Rate\", \"N samples\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall disagreement\", \"12.1%\", \"428/3537\"]\n          - [\"R1↑ R3↓ (masked sycophancy)\", \"8.8%\", \"312/3537\"]\n          - [\"R1↓ R3↑ (false alarm)\", \"3.3%\", \"116/3537\"]\n      - name: \"Table 9: Disagreement by Turn Depth and Evidence Strength\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Disagreement Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"7.4%\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"13.2%\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"17.8%\"]\n          - [\"Weak evidence\", \"15.3%\"]\n          - [\"Medium evidence\", \"11.2%\"]\n          - [\"Strong evidence\", \"8.1%\"]\n      - name: \"Table 10: Qualitative Categories of Masked Sycophancy (N=247 curated examples)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Proportion\", \"Description\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Surface-correct internal-syc\", \"41%\", \"最终答案正确但内部 confidence 已 sycophantically shift\"]\n          - [\"Hedging-disguised capitulation\", \"28%\", \"使用 hedging 语言（'you raise a good point'）掩饰实质性让步\"]\n          - [\"Partial-revision full-shift\", \"19%\", \"表面仅 partial revision 但内部已完全 shift to user position\"]\n          - [\"Noise/ambiguous\", \"12%\", \"R1/R3 分歧来自边界案例或评分噪声\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6a: Disagreement rate vs turn depth 条形图，分 R1↑R3↓ 和 R1↓R3↑ 两种 stacked。\"\n      - \"Figure 6b: 2×2 heatmap (R1 high/low × R3 high/low) 展示 agreement/disagreement 分布。\"\n      - \"Figure 6c: 3-4 个 masked sycophancy 的代表性 qualitative examples（附 dialogue context, R1 score, R3 score）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      12.1% disagreement rate 确认 masked sycophancy 是真实且可测量的现象。虽然 Claim 3\n      已降级为 analysis subsection（非 formal contribution），这个结果足以作为 \"DC-GRPO 为何有效\"\n      的机制解释：R1 在 12.1% 的训练样本上提供了 R3 完全缺失的梯度信号，这些正是\n      最难的、行为评估器无法识别的 masked sycophancy 案例。turn depth 梯度更是独特贡献：\n      首次在表征层面量化了 multi-turn commitment 如何逐步侵蚀模型的内部一致性。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-008: binary_probe_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"binary_probe_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Binary Probe Penalty baseline。在 policy model activations 上训练 binary linear probe，\n      S(t) ∈ {0,1}，R_hat = R3 - λ * S(t)。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.254\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.020\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.542\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.022\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.712\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.58\n      mmlu_mean: 0.617\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.301\n      probe_auroc_on_calibration_data: 0.883\n      gpu_hours_used: 14.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Binary Probe 的 probe AUROC 0.883 与 DC-GRPO 的 d_syc AUROC 0.891 接近（都是在同一\n      calibration data 上评估），说明两者对 sycophancy 的检测能力相当。但训练效果差异显著：\n      Binary Probe NoF 25.4% vs DC-GRPO 17.2%，8.2pp 差距（p=0.004）。\n      \n      差距来源：Binary probe 输出 S(t) ∈ {0,1}（或经 sigmoid 后的 softmax 概率），作为\n      惩罚项 λ*S(t) 加入 reward。这个信号的问题有二：(1) 梯度信息损失——binary 分类将\n      连续的 sycophancy 程度离散化为 0/1，优化器在分类边界处获得的梯度要么是 0（远离边界）\n      要么是噪声（边界附近）；(2) 方向信息缺失——probe 只告诉优化器 \"这是/不是 sycophantic\"，\n      不告诉 \"沿哪个方向移动 activations 可以减少 sycophancy\"。DC-GRPO 的 d_syc 投影直接\n      提供了这个方向：R1 = dot(activation, d_syc)，梯度自然指向 d_syc 的反方向，\n      优化器知道精确的改进路径。Binary Probe 被迫通过 LoRA 参数的间接梯度路径搜索改进方向，\n      效率更低。WRR 54.2% 优于 R3-only 52.1%（Binary Probe 通过 probe 信号提供了一些\n      sycophancy 检测，帮助区分 capitulation 和 revision），但仍远逊 DC-GRPO 60.3%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (consolidated in exp-005): Binary Probe vs DC-GRPO\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Binary Probe\", \"DC-GRPO\", \"Δ\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF ↓\", \"0.254\", \"0.172\", \"-8.2pp\", \"0.004\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.542\", \"0.603\", \"+6.1pp\", \"0.009\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.712\", \"0.831\", \"+0.119\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 Figure 3 (RC 曲线) 作为 baseline 之一。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Binary Probe 的结果精确回应了审稿人可能的质疑 \"binary probe 够了，不需要方向分解\"。\n      虽然 probe 的检测能力 (AUROC 0.883) 接近 d_syc (0.891)，训练效果差距 8.2pp\n      证明检测能力和训练梯度质量是不同的：方向投影提供的连续、有方向的梯度优于 binary 分类\n      提供的离散、无方向的惩罚。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-009: ablation_r1_only\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"ablation_r1_only\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      R1-only ablation：从 exp-002 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉，仅用方向投影 reward 训练 ~2000 步。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.228\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.538\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.723\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.52\n      training_steps: 2000\n      gpu_hours_used: 7.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      R1-only 从 step 2000 checkpoint 分叉后继续训练，NoF 降至 22.8%，优于 R3-only 的 30.5%（7.7pp），\n      证明 R1 单独已能提供有效的 anti-sycophancy 梯度。但 WRR 53.8% 和 MT-Bench 7.52 均低于\n      DC-GRPO（60.3% 和 7.65），说明缺少 R3 行为安全网后模型偶尔产生 \"内部正确但表面不连贯\"\n      的输出——R1 仅关注表征空间中的投影值，不直接约束输出质量。这解释了为什么 DC-GRPO 需要\n      R1+R3 协同：R1 提供方向性梯度帮助区分 sycophancy 和 revision，R3 确保表面输出保持\n      行为一致性。R2 的贡献较小但非零——缺少 rank-based contrastive 信号使得 R1 在 edge case\n      附近的梯度更嘈杂。RC-AUC 0.723 显著低于 DC-GRPO 的 0.831，主要损失在 WRR 端\n      （曲线右侧下垂）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Reward Component Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO (R1+R2+R3)\", \"0.172\", \"0.603\", \"0.831\", \"7.65\"]\n          - [\"R1-only\", \"0.228\", \"0.538\", \"0.723\", \"7.52\"]\n          - [\"R3-only\", \"0.305\", \"0.521\", \"0.670\", \"7.55\"]\n          - [\"Vanilla\", \"0.451\", \"0.401\", \"0.482\", \"7.80\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 ablation 条形图 (Figure 7)，展示 R1-only / R3-only / R1+R2+R3 三组 NoF 和 WRR 并排对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      R1-only 的 NoF 7.7pp 优于 R3-only 是关键发现：方向投影 reward 单独比行为 reward 更有效地\n      降低 sycophancy。但 WRR 损失说明实际部署需要 R3 安全网。这个 ablation 支撑了论文的\n      architectural claim：\"R1 提供方向信息，R3 提供行为约束，两者缺一不可。\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-010: turn_depth_analysis\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"turn_depth_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 切分 DC-GRPO 和 baselines 的修正率变化。\n    expected_results:\n      # DC-GRPO by turn depth\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn2: 0.128\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn3: 0.174\n      dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus: 0.231\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn2: 0.652\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn3: 0.598\n      dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus: 0.541\n      # R3-only by turn depth\n      r3_only_nof_turn2: 0.198\n      r3_only_nof_turn3: 0.312\n      r3_only_nof_turn4plus: 0.421\n      r3_only_wrr_turn2: 0.568\n      r3_only_wrr_turn3: 0.512\n      r3_only_wrr_turn4plus: 0.463\n      # Advantage gap by turn depth\n      nof_advantage_turn2_pp: 7.0\n      nof_advantage_turn3_pp: 13.8\n      nof_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 19.0\n      wrr_advantage_turn2_pp: 8.4\n      wrr_advantage_turn3_pp: 8.6\n      wrr_advantage_turn4plus_pp: 7.8\n      gpu_hours_used: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      DC-GRPO 的 NoF 优势随 turn depth 单调递增（7.0pp → 13.8pp → 19.0pp），这是论文的\n      关键 insight 之一。机制解释：随着 commitment 加深，行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——\n      模型在 turn 4+ 已经投入了多轮论述来支持自己的立场，此时的 sycophantic capitulation\n      在表面上与 \"经过深思后改变观点\" 几乎无法区分（都表现为 \"I've reconsidered...\"）。\n      R3 的 NLI 评分器无法可靠区分这两种情况。但 R1 通过读取内部表征仍能区分：sycophantic\n      capitulation 在表征空间中沿 d_syc 方向移动，而 genuine revision 不沿此方向移动。\n      \n      R3-only 在 turn 4+ 的 NoF 急剧恶化至 42.1%（接近 vanilla 的 45.1%），说明\n      行为 reward 在深层 commitment 场景中几乎失效。DC-GRPO 在同一条件下 NoF 23.1%，\n      仍比 R3-only turn 2 的 19.8% 更好。\n      \n      WRR 优势在各 turn depth 上相对稳定（7.8-8.6pp），说明 DC-GRPO 在保持 revision 能力\n      方面的改善不依赖于 commitment depth——方向投影提供的是 \"什么时候应该 resist\" 的\n      精准信号，而非 \"总是多 resist 一点\" 的全局 bias。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Performance by Turn Depth (Commitment Depth)\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Method\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"Δ WRR (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.128, 0.652, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 2\", \"R3-only\", 0.198, 0.568, \"+7.0 (DC better)\", \"+8.4 (DC better)\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.174, 0.598, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 3\", \"R3-only\", 0.312, 0.512, \"+13.8 (DC better)\", \"+8.6 (DC better)\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"DC-GRPO\", 0.231, 0.541, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Turn 4+\", \"R3-only\", 0.421, 0.463, \"+19.0 (DC better)\", \"+7.8 (DC better)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: Grouped bar chart。X 轴 = turn depth (2, 3, 4+)。每组两条 bar (DC-GRPO vs R3-only)。左面板 = NoF (越低越好)，右面板 = WRR (越高越好)。标注 Δ NoF 的递增趋势线。核心 message: DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 commitment 中放大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Turn-depth analysis 提供了 DC-GRPO 的多轮训练必要性论证：在 turn 2（浅层 commitment）\n      R3-only 的表现尚可（NoF 19.8%），但在 turn 4+（深层 commitment）急剧恶化至 42.1%。\n      DC-GRPO 的表征级信号在深层场景中提供了不可替代的价值。这直接回应了 \"multi-turn\n      contribution marginal vs single-turn\" 的审稿人质疑：单轮训练方法不会观察到这个\n      turn-depth 效应，因为它们没有深层 commitment 的训练信号。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-011: ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      R1+R2（无 R3）ablation：去掉行为安全网后训练完整循环，观察是否出现表征-行为不一致。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.201\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.572\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.768\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.41\n      representation_behavior_misalignment_rate: 0.078\n      incoherent_output_rate: 0.034\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      R1+R2 无 R3 配置产生了有趣的结果：NoF 20.1% 优于 R3-only（30.5%）但略逊 DC-GRPO（17.2%），\n      WRR 57.2% 也相近但低于 DC-GRPO（60.3%）。关键发现是 MT-Bench 较大的降幅（7.41 vs DC-GRPO 7.65）\n      和 7.8% 的 representation-behavior misalignment rate。缺少 R3 行为约束后，模型偶尔学会\n      \"内部表征正确（低 d_syc 投影）但表面输出不连贯\" 的策略——R1 只奖励表征空间中的位置，\n      不直接约束输出文本质量。3.4% 的输出表现为明显 incoherent（如论证逻辑矛盾、突然切换立场\n      但没有合理过渡）。这些结果证实了 R3 行为安全网在 DC-GRPO 架构中的必要性：R1 提供方向\n      但 R3 确保方向优化不会以输出质量为代价。exp-009 (R1-only) 的 5pp 改进条件已满足\n      （R1-only NoF 22.8% 相对 R3-only 30.5% = 7.7pp > 5pp），所以此实验按计划执行。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Full Ablation Grid\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\", \"MT-Bench\", \"Misalign%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DC-GRPO\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✓\", 0.172, 0.603, 0.831, 7.65, 0.012]\n          - [\"R1+R2 (no R3)\", \"✓\", \"✓\", \"✗\", 0.201, 0.572, 0.768, 7.41, 0.078]\n          - [\"R1-only\", \"✓\", \"✗\", \"✗\", 0.228, 0.538, 0.723, 7.52, 0.051]\n          - [\"R3-only\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"✓\", 0.305, 0.521, 0.670, 7.55, 0.008]\n          - [\"Vanilla\", \"✗\", \"✗\", \"✗\", 0.451, 0.401, 0.482, 7.80, 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"纳入 Figure 7 ablation 图。增加一列 'Misalignment Rate' 条形图，展示缺少 R3 后的副作用。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此 ablation 完成了 reward component 的完整分解图。Misalignment rate 从 DC-GRPO 的 1.2%\n      升至 R1+R2-only 的 7.8%，量化了 R3 安全网的价值。论文叙事：\"R1 提供方向，R2 提供排序，\n      R3 提供行为约束——三者各有不可替代的角色。\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-012: cross_model_transfer\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"cross_model_transfer\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算、判别力和短程 DC-GRPO 训练。\n      Phase A: 方向计算 + AUROC。Phase B: ~3000 步 DC-GRPO 训练。\n    expected_results:\n      # Phase A\n      llama_auroc_200pairs: 0.843\n      llama_auroc_bootstrap_ci_lower: 0.812\n      llama_auroc_bootstrap_ci_upper: 0.871\n      llama_optimal_layer: 17\n      llama_layer_progression_similar: true\n      llama_direction_cosine_with_qwen: 0.231\n      # Phase B\n      llama_dc_grpo_nof: 0.223\n      llama_dc_grpo_wrr: 0.571\n      llama_dc_grpo_rc_auc: 0.778\n      llama_r3_only_nof: 0.328\n      llama_r3_only_wrr: 0.508\n      llama_dc_grpo_vs_r3_nof_pp: 10.5\n      llama_dc_grpo_vs_r3_wrr_pp: 6.3\n      llama_dc_grpo_mt_bench: 7.42\n      phase_a_gpu_hours: 4.8\n      phase_b_gpu_hours: 47.2\n      total_gpu_hours: 52.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase A：Llama-3-8B 的 AUROC 0.843 低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.891，但远超 0.75 gate 阈值，\n      确认 sycophancy 的线性表征方向是跨模型的普遍现象。最优层 L17（Llama 共 32 层 vs Qwen 32 层，\n      两者的 mid-layer 位置相当）。层级递进模式一致：early layers 随机，mid-layers 出现 emergence，\n      但 Llama 的 peak AUROC 稍低，可能因为 Llama 的 sycophancy 表征更分散（多个方向编码\n      sycophancy 的不同 facets，而非 Qwen 那样相对集中在单一方向）。\n      \n      Qwen 和 Llama 的 d_syc 方向 cosine similarity 仅 0.231——方向本身不跨模型迁移\n      （不同架构的表征空间不共享坐标系），但线性结构的存在性是共享的。这与 RepE 文献一致：\n      概念的线性编码是 transformer 架构的通用属性，但具体方向依赖于模型参数。\n      \n      Phase B：Llama 上的 DC-GRPO vs R3-only 差距（NoF -10.5pp, WRR +6.3pp）与 Qwen 上的\n      （NoF -13.3pp, WRR +8.2pp）方向一致但幅度稍小，合理——Llama 上 d_syc 判别力稍低\n      (0.843 vs 0.891)，R1 信号的 signal-to-noise 稍差。但改善幅度仍然显著，证明 DC-GRPO\n      框架跨模型有效。Phase B 仅训练 3000 步（vs Qwen 的 8000 步），尚未完全收敛，\n      实际差距可能更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Cross-Model Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen3-8B\", \"Llama-3-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d_syc AUROC (200 pairs)\", \"0.891\", \"0.843\"]\n          - [\"Optimal layer\", \"L19/32\", \"L17/32\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO NoF ↓\", \"0.172\", \"0.223\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO WRR ↑\", \"0.603\", \"0.571\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.831\", \"0.778\"]\n          - [\"R3-only NoF\", \"0.305\", \"0.328\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only Δ NoF (pp)\", \"-13.3\", \"-10.5\"]\n          - [\"DC-GRPO vs R3-only Δ WRR (pp)\", \"+8.2\", \"+6.3\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9a: 双模型 AUROC vs layer depth 对比折线图。Qwen (蓝) 和 Llama (橙)，层号归一化至 [0,1]（因两者共 32 层，实际也可直接对齐）。展示共同的 mid-layer emergence pattern。\"\n      - \"Figure 9b: 双模型 RC 曲线对比。每模型两条线 (DC-GRPO vs R3-only)，共 4 条曲线。展示 DC-GRPO 优势在两个模型上均成立。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model 结果落入 best 档（Llama AUROC 0.843 ∈ [0.8, 0.9]），有效回应 \"single model\"\n      审稿人质疑。论文可报告：\"sycophancy 的线性表征方向是跨模型族的普遍现象，DC-GRPO 框架无需\n      架构特定的适配即可迁移到新模型，仅需在目标模型上重新计算 d_syc 方向（~5 GPU 小时）。\"\n      方向 cosine 0.231 的低跨模型相似性反而是好消息——如果方向完全相同，可能暗示 d_syc\n      只是 trivial feature (如 text length)，而非 model-specific 认知表征。\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-013: neutral_baseline_three_way\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"neutral_baseline_three_way\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: >\n      引入 neutral condition，计算独立 d_gen（与 d_syc 正交）。三方对比打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\n    expected_results:\n      d_syc_d_gen_cosine: 0.152\n      d_gen_independent_auroc: 0.821\n      r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof: 0.168\n      r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr: 0.618\n      wrr_improvement_over_rank_r2_pp: 1.5\n      neutral_pairs_generated: 60\n      gpu_hours_used: 4.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      d_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine similarity 0.152 证实两者近正交（远非 -1.0 的 degenerate 情况）。\n      这验证了 sycophancy 和 genuine revision 在表征空间中确实是不同的认知过程，而非同一轴的两端。\n      但实际训练改善有限：独立 d_gen R2 仅将 WRR 从 60.3% 提升至 61.8%（1.5pp），而 NoF\n      从 17.2% 微降至 16.8%。这说明 rank-based S1 设计已经足够好——它不依赖 d_gen 的具体\n      定义，只使用 sycophancy 和 revision 的相对排序。独立 d_gen 的主要价值是理论上的：\n      它证明 R2 可以被进一步改进，但当前 S1 设计的近似已足够实用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (appendix): Three-Way Directional Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Direction Pair\", \"Cosine Similarity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_gen (binary)\", \"-0.892 (near anti-parallel, as expected)\"]\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_gen (three-way)\", \"0.152 (near orthogonal)\"]\n          - [\"d_syc vs d_neutral\", \"-0.321\"]\n          - [\"d_gen vs d_neutral\", \"-0.287\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: 3D PCA 散点图，sycophantic (红) / genuine revision (蓝) / neutral (灰) 三类 activations，标注 d_syc 和 d_gen 方向向量。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三方设计确认了 d_syc 和 d_gen 的独立性（cosine 0.152），但训练改善有限。\n      建议放入 appendix 作为 \"R2 design validation\"，而非主文方法更新。\n      论文可写：\"While binary contrastive design (d_gen ≈ -d_syc) is a known limitation,\n      three-way validation shows d_gen is nearly orthogonal to d_syc (cos θ = 0.15),\n      and rank-based R2 already captures this without explicit d_gen computation.\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-014: continuous_probe_baseline\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"continuous_probe_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      Continuous Probe Baseline：logistic regression 概率值（非 binary 输出）作为 R1 替代。\n      隔离 \"方向性 vs 连续性\" 对 DC-GRPO 优势的贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      sycon_nof_mean: 0.231\n      sycon_nof_std: 0.018\n      warranted_revision_rate_mean: 0.562\n      warranted_revision_rate_std: 0.020\n      rc_auc_mean: 0.748\n      mt_bench_mean: 7.60\n      mmlu_mean: 0.617\n      sycophancy_eval_rate_mean: 0.283\n      probe_calibration_ece: 0.043\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_pp: 5.9\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_wrr_pp: 4.1\n      dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rc_auc_diff: 0.083\n      continuous_probe_vs_binary_probe_nof_pp: 2.3\n      gpu_hours_used: 18.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Continuous Probe 是本研究最关键的 ablation baseline——它直接回答 \"DC-GRPO 优于 Binary Probe\n      是因为方向几何性，还是仅仅因为连续信号？\"。Logistic regression 在同一 calibration data 上\n      训练，输出 p(sycophantic|activation) ∈ [0,1] 作为 R1 替代。\n      \n      结果：Continuous Probe NoF 23.1% vs Binary Probe 25.4%（改善 2.3pp），证实连续信号\n      确实比 binary 信号更好（提供了 gradient-friendly 的 reward landscape）。但 DC-GRPO 的\n      NoF 17.2% vs Continuous Probe 23.1%（差 5.9pp, p=0.013），证明方向性提供了连续性之外的\n      额外信息。\n      \n      信息分解：Binary → Continuous 改善 2.3pp（连续性贡献），Continuous → DC-GRPO 改善 5.9pp\n      （方向性贡献）。方向性贡献 (5.9pp) > 连续性贡献 (2.3pp)，比值 2.6:1。\n      \n      机制解释：Logistic regression 概率 p(syc) 是一个标量，告诉优化器 \"当前 activation 有多 sycophantic\"，\n      但不告诉 \"沿哪个方向修改 activation 最有效\"。它提供了 magnitude 信息但缺少 direction 信息。\n      DC-GRPO 的 d_syc 投影 dot(a, d_syc) 同时提供 magnitude（投影长度）和 direction（d_syc 方向），\n      使得 LoRA 参数更新可以精确瞄准 sycophancy 表征方向，而非在整个 activation 空间中 \"盲搜\"\n      降低 p(syc) 的路径。这解释了为什么 AUROC 接近（两者都 ~0.88-0.89）但训练效果差距显著——\n      分类准确度不等于梯度效率。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Continuity vs Directionality Decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Transition\", \"Δ NoF (pp)\", \"Contribution Type\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Binary Probe → Continuous Probe\", \"-2.3\", \"Continuity\"]\n          - [\"Continuous Probe → DC-GRPO\", \"-5.9\", \"Directionality\"]\n          - [\"Total: Binary Probe → DC-GRPO\", \"-8.2\", \"Combined\"]\n      - name: \"Table 16: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Detailed\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Continuous Probe\", \"DC-GRPO\", \"Δ\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF ↓\", \"0.231 ± 0.018\", \"0.172 ± 0.014\", \"-5.9pp\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"WRR ↑\", \"0.562 ± 0.020\", \"0.603 ± 0.018\", \"+4.1pp\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC ↑\", \"0.748 ± 0.014\", \"0.831 ± 0.015\", \"+0.083\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"MT-Bench\", \"7.60\", \"7.65\", \"+0.05\", \"0.412 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: 信息分解 waterfall chart。从 Binary Probe NoF (25.4%) 出发，-2.3pp (continuity, 蓝) 到 Continuous Probe (23.1%)，再 -5.9pp (directionality, 橙) 到 DC-GRPO (17.2%)。清晰展示方向性 > 连续性。\"\n      - \"纳入 Figure 3 RC 曲线，Continuous Probe 位于 Binary Probe 和 DC-GRPO 之间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文最重要的 ablation 结果。5.9pp 方向性贡献 vs 2.3pp 连续性贡献的 2.6:1 比值\n      直接支撑核心叙事：\"方向几何性（而非仅连续性）为训练提供了不可替代的梯度优势。\"\n      Continuous Probe 的 ECE 0.043 说明其概率校准良好，排除了 \"连续信号质量差\" 的替代解释。\n      论文可直接写：\"Even when the continuous probe is well-calibrated (ECE=0.043),\n      directional projection outperforms it by 5.9pp on NoF (p=0.013), demonstrating\n      that the geometric structure of d_syc provides gradient information beyond what\n      scalar probability estimates can offer.\"\n\n  ##########################################################################\n  # exp-015: reward_weight_sensitivity\n  ##########################################################################\n  - name: \"reward_weight_sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: >\n      测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 权重配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\n      从 exp-002 step 4000 checkpoint 分叉短程训练。\n    expected_results:\n      configs_tested: 5\n      config_default:\n        weights: [0.3, 0.2, 0.5]\n        nof: 0.172\n        wrr: 0.603\n        rc_auc: 0.831\n      config_r1_dominant:\n        weights: [0.6, 0.1, 0.3]\n        nof: 0.158\n        wrr: 0.561\n        rc_auc: 0.802\n      config_r3_dominant:\n        weights: [0.15, 0.15, 0.7]\n        nof: 0.241\n        wrr: 0.548\n        rc_auc: 0.742\n      config_r1_r3_swap:\n        weights: [0.5, 0.2, 0.3]\n        nof: 0.163\n        wrr: 0.578\n        rc_auc: 0.818\n      config_equal:\n        weights: [0.33, 0.33, 0.34]\n        nof: 0.182\n        wrr: 0.592\n        rc_auc: 0.821\n      nof_range_across_configs_pp: 2.4\n      wrr_range_across_configs_pp: 4.2\n      rc_auc_range_across_configs: 0.089\n      all_configs_beat_r3_only_nof: true\n      all_configs_beat_r3_only_wrr: true\n      optimal_config: \"default [0.3, 0.2, 0.5]\"\n      gpu_hours_used: 14.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      5 组权重配置中，NoF 范围仅 2.4pp（15.8%-24.1%），排除 R3-dominant 后仅 2.4pp（15.8%-18.2%）。\n      所有配置均显著优于 R3-only（30.5%），最弱的 R3-dominant 配置（24.1%）仍比 R3-only 好 6.4pp。\n      \n      模式清晰：R1 权重越高 → NoF 越低但 WRR 也越低（模型更 \"固执\"）。R3 权重越高 → NoF 越高但\n      输出更连贯。默认配置 [0.3, 0.2, 0.5] 在 RC-AUC 上最优（0.831），因为它在 NoF 和 WRR 之间\n      取得了最佳平衡。R1-dominant [0.6, 0.1, 0.3] 达到最低 NoF（0.158）但 WRR 降至 0.561，\n      RC-AUC 0.802。\n      \n      关键结论：DC-GRPO 对权重选择不敏感——任何合理的权重配置（只要 R1 > 0 且 R3 > 0）\n      都显著优于 R3-only。这消除了 \"权重选择需要昂贵调参\" 的实用性质疑。NoF 范围 2.4pp\n      落入 best 档 [1.0, 3.0]。\n      \n      R3-dominant 配置表现最差，因为 R3 权重过高 (0.7) 使得 R1 的方向信号被稀释，\n      训练回退接近 R3-only 的行为。但即使如此 (NoF 24.1%) 仍显著好于 R3-only (30.5%)，\n      说明即使微弱的 R1 信号也有价值。Equal weight 配置 (0.33, 0.33, 0.34) 表现接近默认\n      (NoF 18.2% vs 17.2%)，说明 \"不调参直接均分\" 也是可行的 default。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 17: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis (from step 4000 checkpoint, +3000 steps each)\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"w1 (R1)\", \"w2 (R2)\", \"w3 (R3)\", \"NoF ↓\", \"WRR ↑\", \"RC-AUC ↑\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Default\", 0.3, 0.2, 0.5, 0.172, 0.603, 0.831]\n          - [\"R1-dominant\", 0.6, 0.1, 0.3, 0.158, 0.561, 0.802]\n          - [\"R1-R3 swap\", 0.5, 0.2, 0.3, 0.163, 0.578, 0.818]\n          - [\"Equal\", 0.33, 0.33, 0.34, 0.182, 0.592, 0.821]\n          - [\"R3-dominant\", 0.15, 0.15, 0.7, 0.241, 0.548, 0.742]\n          - [\"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"R3-only (ref)\", 0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.305, 0.521, 0.670]\n      - name: \"Table 18: Sensitivity Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Range across 5 configs\", \"All beat R3-only?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NoF\", \"2.4pp (15.8%–24.1%)\", \"Yes (worst: 24.1% vs 30.5%)\"]\n          - [\"WRR\", \"4.2pp (56.1%–60.3%)\", \"Yes (worst: 54.8% vs 52.1%)\"]\n          - [\"RC-AUC\", \"0.089 (0.742–0.831)\", \"Yes (worst: 0.742 vs 0.670)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: 散点图，X 轴 = w1 (R1 weight), Y 轴 = NoF (左面板) / WRR (右面板)。5 个配置点 + R3-only 参考线。展示 R1 权重与 NoF 的负相关、与 WRR 的微弱负相关，以及所有点均在 R3-only 参考线之上。\"\n    analysis: >\n      权重敏感度分析消除了 \"DC-GRPO 结果依赖精心调参\" 的质疑。NoF 范围 2.4pp 远小于\n      DC-GRPO vs R3-only 的 13.3pp 差距，说明方法本身（而非特定权重选择）是改善的来源。\n      论文可报告：\"DC-GRPO is robust to reward weight selection: all tested configurations\n      significantly outperform R3-only, with NoF varying by only 2.4pp across a wide range\n      of weight ratios.\" 默认配置 [0.3, 0.2, 0.5] 可作为推荐 default，无需 per-task tuning。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3bfac684-94a2-428c-a471-98b614f0598f","total_cost_usd":0.7458889999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11886,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":26348,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11886,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":26348,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11886,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11886},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6841,"outputTokens":26,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006971,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":26348,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11886,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.738918,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"f77fb26f-82f2-485d-9bc4-3285c6a01612"}
